{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NwwNpnKWjVD3JvNZP3rmVt","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — gen-depth-contamination\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\t- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (ARR submission May 25, 2026)\n5\t- Fallback: EMNLP 2026 Findings\n6\t- Backup: AAAI 2027 (abstract July 25, paper August 1)\n7\t\n8\t## Canonical Experimental Condition\n9\t\n10\t**Continuation mode 是 cross-model 结论的基础。**\n11\t\n12\t> \"We evaluate both generation modes because real-world recursive contamination can arise from either. Our analysis reveals generation mode as a significant confound, leading us to recommend continuation mode as the canonical condition for cross-model comparisons.\"\n13\t\n14\t| Condition | Pythia↔OLMo | Qwen↔others | 论文定位 |\n15\t|-----------|-------------|-------------|---------|\n16\t| Continuation | 90-92% retention | 80-85% retention | **主实验条件** — cross-model claims 的基础 |\n17\t| Rewrite (instruction) | N/A | 61-63% retention | **upper bound with mode-specific confound** — 仅作 ablation |\n18\t\n19\t**原则**：\n20\t- C1' 的跨模型 claim 必须基于 continuation mode 数据\n21\t- Rewrite mode 的高 AUC (0.6957 vs cont 0.6114) 是 mode-specific signal amplification，不能作为泛化性证据\n22\t- mvp-001 (Qwen-rewrite) 定位为 \"pilot study demonstrating feasibility\"，后续用 continuation mode rigorously validate\n23\t- cont→rw 89% vs rw→cont 82% 不对称性 → continuation features 是 rewrite 的通用子集\n24\t\n25\t## Core Claims (2+1 结构, updated D049/D050)\n26\t\n27\t### Primary: C1' (K* Characterization — Domain-Dependent Bounded Saturation)\n28\t首次系统测量递归合成文本的 generational discrimination boundary K*，demonstrating that K* is low-bounded (≤3) and domain-dependent。\n29\t\n30\tDPI 理论证明有限 K*_theory 必然存在（信息论 impossibility boundary）；我们首次在受控实验中测量 K*_empirical，它提供 K*_theory 的保守下界。通过 8 model configurations（5 architecture families, 1B-8B）、3 source domains（C4, Wikipedia, arXiv）、4 decoding strategies 系统表征 K*_empirical 的行为，发现：\n31\t\n32\t- **K*∈{1,2,3} at θ=0.60**：K* 是有界的且域依赖的，呈现三级域阶梯：Wikipedia(1) < C4(2) < arXiv(3)\n33\t- **Web text K*=2 是 dominant mode**（7/8 configurations），展现跨模型架构、跨解码策略的一致性\n34\t- **Structured academic text (arXiv) K*=3**，经五个模型配置、四个架构族 cross-validate（Qwen-1.5B, Qwen-7B, Pythia-1.4B, LLaMA-8B, Mistral-7B; 5/5 domain-competent models, 100%）\n35\t- **Wikipedia K*=1 (scorer-controlled)**：全部 6 个模型在 cross-family scorer 控制后均 K*=1。Qwen 生成器在 same-family scorer 下的 K*=2 是 scorer family bias artifact（D060 确认），正文报告 scorer-controlled 值，Appendix 披露 confound 细节\n36\t- **Mistral-7B K*=1 on C4 but K*=3 on arXiv**：domain-specific one-wash，最强 domain dependence 证据\n37\t- **Domain 是 K* 的唯一主导因素**：scorer control 后，model scale/architecture/decoding strategy 均不改变域内 K* 一致性\n38\t- **One-wash laundering effect**：对 web text 和 Wikipedia，单次生成即令文本与更深层合成内容不可区分\n39\t\n40\t**子组件：**\n41\t\n42\t**(a) K*=2 as dominant mode for web text (7/8 configurations)**\n43\t> **7/8 model configurations yield K*=2 on C4 web text：**\n44\t>\n45\t> | Model | Experiment | AUC 1v2 | 95% CI | CI lower > 0.60? |\n46\t> |-------|-----------|---------|--------|-----------------|\n47\t> | Qwen-1.5B-Instruct rewrite | mvp-001 | 0.6957 | [0.6859, 0.7041] | ✅ (+8.6pp) |\n48\t> | Pythia-1.4B cont | exp-001 | 0.6539 | [0.6454, 0.6630] | ✅ (+4.5pp) |\n49\t> | Qwen-1.5B base cont | exp-016 | 0.6262 | [0.6168, 0.6353] | ✅ (+1.7pp) |\n50\t> | Qwen2.5-7B cont | exp-004 | 0.6178 | [0.6079, 0.6261] | ✅ (+0.79pp) |\n51\t> | OLMo-1B cont | exp-002 | 0.6145 | [0.6045, 0.6247] | ✅ (+0.45pp) |\n52\t> | LLaMA-3.1-8B cont | exp-018 | 0.6123 | [0.6028, 0.6216] | ✅ (+0.28pp) |\n53\t> | Qwen-1.5B-Instruct cont | exp-017 | 0.6112 | [0.6015, 0.6213] | ✅ (+0.15pp) |\n54\t>\n55\t> *Exception: Mistral-7B cont (exp-019): 1v2=0.5935, CI [0.5835, 0.6032], K*=1*\n56\t>\n57\t> *Decoding strategy invariance (exp-003):*\n58\t> | Decoding | AUC 1v2 | K* |\n59\t> |----------|---------|-----|\n60\t> | greedy | 0.6893 | 2 |\n61\t> | nucleus p=0.9 | 0.6866 | 2 |\n62\t> | temp=0.7 | 0.6887 | 2 |\n63\t> | temp=1.2 | 0.7039 | 2 |\n64\t>\n65\t> - 7/8 configurations 1v2 CI lower > 0.60, 全部 2v3 CI upper < 0.60\n66\t> - 4 decoding strategies AUC 1v2 range [0.6866, 0.7039], K* 完全不变\n67\t> - ⚠️ Qwen-cont 1v2 CI lower=0.6015 极边缘；cross-scorer validation 下降至 K*=1\n68\t> - ⚠️ θ-sensitivity: θ=0.60 下 7/8 K*=2; θ=0.70 下多数降至 K*=1\n69\t> - Paper 措辞：\"K*=2 emerges as the dominant mode for general web text (7/8 model configurations), demonstrating consistency across diverse architectures and decoding strategies.\"\n70\t\n71\t**(b) Domain dependence: arXiv K*=3 (5-model cross-validated, D055/D056/D057)**\n72\t> - **Qwen-1.5B on arXiv** (exp-024): 2v3 AUC=0.6427, CI [0.6275, 0.6575], K*=3 ✅ (+2.75pp)\n73\t> - **Pythia-1.4B on arXiv** (exp-025): 2v3 AUC=0.6544, CI [0.6401, 0.6688], K*=3 ✅ (+4.01pp)\n74\t> - **LLaMA-3.1-8B on arXiv** (exp_arXiv_llama8b): 2v3 AUC=0.6215, K*=3 ✅ (+2.15pp)\n75\t> - **Mistral-7B on arXiv** (exp_arXiv_mistral7b): 2v3 AUC=0.6275, all folds > 0.60, K*=3 ✅ (+2.75pp)\n76\t> - **Qwen-7B on arXiv** (exp_arXiv_qwen7b): 2v3 AUC=0.6255, all folds > 0.60, K*=3 ✅ (+2.55pp)\n77\t> - 五个模型配置、四个架构族（1.4B-8B）在 arXiv 上 100% 一致 K*=3（5/5 domain-competent models，仅 OLMo capacity failure）\n78\t> - OLMo-1B K*=1 (exp_arXiv_olmo): capacity failure — 生成完全出域文本，不影响 domain property claim，作为 \"domain competence prerequisite\" 分析放 Appendix\n79\t> - **Mistral C4 K*=1 → arXiv K*=3 是 domain dependence 的最强证据**：同一模型在不同域给出不同 K*，证明 K* 由 domain structure 主导而非 model identity\n80\t> - **解释**：arXiv 的结构化特征（LaTeX formatting, citation patterns, mathematical notation）提供额外 depth-distinguishing signal，使辨别力多延伸一代\n81\t> - Sample size: n=2,200 per model\n82\t> - ⚠️ LLaMA fold 0=0.5969 < θ, bootstrap CI lower 可能接近 0.60 边界。论文措辞用 \"K*=3 with boundary pair AUC of 0.62\" 而非 \"robustly K*=3\"\n83\t> - 论文定位：**domain dependence 是核心发现**——K* 由源文本结构复杂度决定，非纯模型属性。4-model cross-validation 大幅强化证据链\n84\t\n85\t**(c) Mistral K*=1 on web text: domain-specific one-wash (D056)**\n86\t> - Mistral-7B 在 C4 web text 上 1v2 AUC CI lower < 0.60, K*=1\n87\t> - Cross-scorer validation (exp-022): 使用其他模型 score Mistral 生成的文本，K*=1 maintained → C4 上的 K*=1 是 text-intrinsic（非 scorer artifact）\n88\t> - **但 Mistral arXiv K*=3 (exp_arXiv_mistral7b) 证明 one-wash 是 domain-specific 而非 model-intrinsic**\n89\t> - **One-wash laundering**：对 web text 这类 homogeneous 域，Mistral 单次生成即令文本在统计上不可区分于更深层合成；但 structured domains (arXiv) 能 rescue even Mistral from one-wash\n90\t> - 论文定位：Mistral C4→arXiv 的 K* 跃变（1→3）是 (model × domain) interaction 的典型案例，进一步证明 domain structure 是 K* 的主要决定因素\n91\t\n92\t**(d) Cross-model transfer (scorer invariance)**\n93\t> - Pythia↔OLMo 90-92% accuracy retention → K* 不是 model self-familiarity artifact\n94\t> - 0v1 AUC > 0.96 across all transfer pairs → binary contamination signal 完全跨模型可迁移\n95\t> - Cross-scorer validation (exp-022): 11/12 generator×scorer combos yield K*=2 → K* governed by generation process, not scoring model\n96\t> - Feature ordering: scorer-invariant Spearman ρ > 0.90\n97\t> - 论文定位：confirms K* is a property of the text/generation process, not the measurement apparatus\n98\t\n99\t**(e) Representation dependence of K* (Neural Probe)**\n100\t> - exp-015 完整 3 模型结果（frozen self-embeddings + MLP probe）:\n101\t>   - Qwen-cont: K*(neural)=3, 2v3 AUC=0.6159, CI [0.6099, 0.6223], CI lower > 0.60 ✅\n102\t>   - Pythia-1.4B: K*(neural)=2, 2v3 AUC=0.5963, CI [0.5892, 0.6033], CI lower < 0.60 ❌\n103\t>   - OLMo-1B: K*(neural)=2, 2v3 AUC=0.5892, CI [0.5818, 0.5965], CI lower < 0.60 ❌\n104\t> - K*(neural) 是 model-dependent：Qwen K*=3, Pythia/OLMo K*=2\n105\t> - 15D model-free features 给出一致的 K* across all models，neural probe 给出 model-dependent K*\n106\t> - Interpretability-deployability tradeoff: model-free features 的 universality 优势在 cross-model 结果下更明显\n107\t> - 论文定位：validates choice of model-free 15D features for headline characterization\n108\t\n109\t**(f) Generation mode analysis (§4.x Analysis subsection)**\n110\t> - Signal strength: rewrite AUC 1v2=0.6957 vs continuation 0.6114（Δ=+8.4pp）\n111\t> - Transferability: continuation 80-92% retention vs rewrite 61-63%\n112\t> - Feature subset: cont→rw 89% > rw→cont 82% → continuation features 是 rewrite 的通用子集\n113\t> - Interpretation: rewrite mode 的 instruction-following 引入 mode-specific style artifacts，放大 depth signal 但降低跨模型泛化性\n114\t> - 论文定位：Analysis subsection，不是独立 claim\n115\t\n116\t### Secondary: C3 (K*-Aware Data Curation Validation)\n117\tDomain-appropriate K* correctly predicts optimal curation granularity: for web text (K*=2), binary K*-aware filtering (0.5941 MMLU) outperforms graduated depth weighting (best 0.5892 at α=0.9), surprisal-based selection (0.5894), and DSIR distribution matching (~0.5867, ≈ no-filter level). Dose-response analysis (exp-009 v3, 3 ratios × 3 strategies × 5 seeds) confirms binary filtering maintains consistent advantage across 10%/30%/50% contamination ratios (HellaSwag significantly better at all levels, p≤0.004), while graduated filtering collapses to no-filter baseline performance. K* serves as an actionable curation guideline: the domain-dependent discrimination boundary directly determines the optimal filtering granularity.\n118\t\n119\t> ⚠️ Defensive framing constraint (D053): MMLU at 30% ratio p=0.074 不显著, 不能 claim \"universally beneficial\"。维持 \"consistent advantage\" 措辞，以 HellaSwag 显著性为主要证据。\n120\t\n121\t### Supporting Analysis: Canonical Condition Selection\n122\tGeneration mode 是 depth estimation 的显著混淆变量。Methodology 段落阐述 continuation mode 作为 canonical condition 的选择及理由（不作为独立 claim）。\n123\t\n124\t## Story Spine\n125\t\n126\t- **Problem**: Web 数据正被多代递归合成文本污染。当前检测方法将合成文本视为 binary 类别（real vs synthetic），但质量随代际深度非线性退化——首代合成文本与四代合成文本的质量差异巨大却被忽视。\n127\t- **Existing approaches & gaps**: Binary detectors (DivEye, Min-K%++) 不区分代际；model collapse 文献 (Shumailov et al., Alemohammad et al. 2024, Dohmatob et al. 2024) 描述宏观现象但不提供检测工具；data selection methods (DSIR, D4, DoReMi) 做分布匹配但不估计递归深度；Drayson et al. (2025) 将 binary MGT detection 应用于 importance resampling 以防止 model collapse，是目前最接近的工作。然而这些方法均做二值判断，**不估计文本经历了多少轮递归生成，也不量化辨别能力的饱和边界。**\n128\t- **Our framing**: 将递归生成建模为 iterated lossy channel，从信息论（DPI）推导出 K* 的必然存在。K* 是首次系统测量的 operational quantity——它告诉数据策展者\"在什么深度以下，depth-aware curation 比 binary detection 更有价值\"。通过 8 model configurations（5 architecture families, 1B-8B）、3 source domains、4 decoding strategies 系统表征 K*，揭示其 **bounded domain-dependent** 本质：**K*∈{1,2,3}**，形成清晰的三级域阶梯——Wikipedia K*=1（6 models, scorer-controlled），C4 web text K*=2（7/8 configurations），arXiv K*=3（5/5 domain-competent models, 4 architecture families）。Domain 是 K* 的唯一主导因素：scorer confound 控制后，model identity/scale/decoding strategy 均不改变域内一致性。这一发现意味着递归生成信息丧失极快——one to two generation passes suffice to erase distinguishable depth structure（\"one-wash laundering\" effect）。Domain dependence 为数据治理提供 actionable guidance：源文本的结构复杂度决定了 depth-aware filtering 的适用粒度。\n129\t- **Headline result template**: \"Recursive generation has a bounded discrimination boundary at K*∈{1,2,3}, forming a three-level domain hierarchy: Wikipedia saturates at K*=1 (all 6 models, scorer-controlled), web text at K*=2 (7/8 model configurations, 5 architecture families, 1B-8B), and structured academic text extends to K*=3 (cross-validated across 5 models, 4 architecture families). Domain structural complexity is the sole systematic determinant of K*. Cross-model transfer retention of 80-92% and scorer-invariant feature ordering (ρ>0.90) confirm depth features are text-intrinsic. Domain-appropriate K* correctly predicts optimal curation granularity.\"\n130\t\n131\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Responses\n132\t\n133\t1. **\"K*∈{1,2,3} 范围太小，结论是否 trivial？\"** → 恰好相反：K* 的低有界性是核心发现。DPI 理论只保证 K* 有限但不给上界；我们首次实证表明 K*≤3（即递归信息丧失极快），且 domain dependence 揭示了结构化文本如何延缓信息退化。One-wash laundering effect 对 data governance 有直接实践意义。\n134\t2. **\"只基于小模型（≤8B），能推广到更大模型吗？\"** → 5 architecture families (1B-8B) 覆盖了当前开源生态的主要架构。DPI 理论保证 K*_theory 对任意规模模型存在。Cross-scorer validation 表明 K* 由生成过程而非评分模型决定。扩展至 13B+/70B+ 是重要 future work。\n135\t3. **\"只是 feature engineering + off-the-shelf classifier，方法贡献弱\"** → 贡献在 problem formulation + empirical characterization（首次测量 K*）+ 理论框架（DPI）+ domain-dependent bounded saturation 发现，不是分类器本身。Model-free features 的选择被 cross-model transfer 80-92% 和 scorer invariance 验证为正确设计。\n136\t4. **\"arXiv K*=3 样本量够吗？\"** → 五个模型（Qwen-1.5B, Qwen-7B, Pythia-1.4B, LLaMA-8B, Mistral-7B）跨四个架构族均给出 K*=3，每模型 n=2,200，bootstrap CI 确认统计显著。5/5 domain-competent models 100% 一致性排除 model-specific artifact。\n137\t5. **\"Mistral K*=1 是 outlier 还是 systematic？\"** → Cross-scorer validation 确认是 text-intrinsic（非 scorer artifact）。Mistral 可能因训练数据/alignment 差异导致生成文本在一代后即失去 depth-distinguishing structure。这强化了 domain/model dependence 的核心论点。\n138\t6. **\"Prompt-chain 不代表真实世界递归污染\"** → Prompt-chain 隔离纯文本退化效应（text-intrinsic degradation），是更 generalizable 的实验设计。**exp-008 实证验证**：retrain-chain (Pythia-1.4B LoRA) K*≥4（1v2=0.9484, 2v3=0.8888, 3v4=0.7982），远高于 prompt-chain K*=2。原因：LoRA fine-tune 每代引入累积模型 artifacts（vocabulary narrowing, repetition bias），使各代高度可区分。这些 model-adaptation artifacts 是 setup-specific 的，不泛化到 wild contamination scenarios。因此 prompt-chain K*=2 是 data curation 的 operational boundary（仅反映 text-intrinsic information loss），而非 retrain-chain 的 upper bound。\n139\t7. **\"同模型做生成和 surprisal 计算有 bias\"** → **exp-013/exp-022 直接反驳**：cross-scorer validation 11/12 combos yield K*=2, Pythia↔OLMo 90-92% accuracy retention。K* governed by generation process, not scoring model。**D060 进一步证实**：Wikipedia 上 Qwen same-family scorer 的 +1 bias 被 Pythia cross-family scorer 消除（K*=2→1），证明 scorer confound 可被检测和控制，且仅影响特定 model-family×domain 组合（不影响 C4 主线结论）。\n140\t8. **\"为什么不用 learned representations\"** → **exp-015 直接回应**：neural probe K* 是 model-dependent（Qwen=3, Pythia/OLMo=2），而 15D model-free features 给出一致的 K* across all models。Model-free 方案的 universality + cross-model transferability 是 practical advantage。\n141\t9. **\"θ=0.60 选择是否 arbitrary？\"** → 三层辩护：(1) Cohen's h≈0.20 small effect size threshold, (2) permutation test 校准, (3) AUC gap 在 boundary 处的 sharp discontinuity（1v2 vs 2v3 gap 大于 θ 选择的 sensitivity range）。θ-sensitivity analysis [0.55, 0.70] 在主文呈现。\n142\t10. **\"Graduated filtering 没和 data selection methods 比\"** → exp-006 包含 DSIR baseline + α sensitivity sweep，binary K*-aware filtering outperforms all tested alternatives。\n143\t\n144\t## Venue Fit\n145\t\n146\t- EMNLP 2026 special theme 明确呼吁 data contamination, synthetic data feedback loops, data governance 方向的工作\n147\t- 2+1 claim 结构：C1' 是 comprehensive characterization study with domain-dependent bounded saturation finding，C3 是 practical application，generation mode analysis 增加深度\n148\t- **Domain-dependent bounded saturation narrative** 比 universality 更准确且更有 impact：K*∈{1,2,3} 的 bounded range + domain dependence 是 nuanced scientific finding，比 \"K*=2 everywhere\" 更可信且更 interesting（审稿人不必怀疑过度外推）\n149\t- One-wash laundering effect 是 memorable concept 便于传播\n150\t- 风险：K* range 小（1-3）可能被认为 trivial → 论文须强调 bounded ≤3 本身是 surprising（DPI 不给上界），且 domain dependence 是 actionable（不同域需不同 curation 策略）\n151\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2db4af87-0b62-4e08-8d83-6a4871881bec","uuid":"f9f36d8a-5533-4e4b-a65c-59144a9fc9f9","timestamp":"2026-05-18T13:20:59.077Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_7/projects/gen-depth-contamination/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T125757/median/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — gen-depth-contamination\n\n## Target Venue\n- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (ARR submission May 25, 2026)\n- Fallback: EMNLP 2026 Findings\n- Backup: AAAI 2027 (abstract July 25, paper August 1)\n\n## Canonical Experimental Condition\n\n**Continuation mode 是 cross-model 结论的基础。**\n\n> \"We evaluate both generation modes because real-world recursive contamination can arise from either. Our analysis reveals generation mode as a significant confound, leading us to recommend continuation mode as the canonical condition for cross-model comparisons.\"\n\n| Condition | Pythia↔OLMo | Qwen↔others | 论文定位 |\n|-----------|-------------|-------------|---------|\n| Continuation | 90-92% retention | 80-85% retention | **主实验条件** — cross-model claims 的基础 |\n| Rewrite (instruction) | N/A | 61-63% retention | **upper bound with mode-specific confound** — 仅作 ablation |\n\n**原则**：\n- C1' 的跨模型 claim 必须基于 continuation mode 数据\n- Rewrite mode 的高 AUC (0.6957 vs cont 0.6114) 是 mode-specific signal amplification，不能作为泛化性证据\n- mvp-001 (Qwen-rewrite) 定位为 \"pilot study demonstrating feasibility\"，后续用 continuation mode rigorously validate\n- cont→rw 89% vs rw→cont 82% 不对称性 → continuation features 是 rewrite 的通用子集\n\n## Core Claims (2+1 结构, updated D049/D050)\n\n### Primary: C1' (K* Characterization — Domain-Dependent Bounded Saturation)\n首次系统测量递归合成文本的 generational discrimination boundary K*，demonstrating that K* is low-bounded (≤3) and domain-dependent。\n\nDPI 理论证明有限 K*_theory 必然存在（信息论 impossibility boundary）；我们首次在受控实验中测量 K*_empirical，它提供 K*_theory 的保守下界。通过 8 model configurations（5 architecture families, 1B-8B）、3 source domains（C4, Wikipedia, arXiv）、4 decoding strategies 系统表征 K*_empirical 的行为，发现：\n\n- **K*∈{1,2,3} at θ=0.60**：K* 是有界的且域依赖的，呈现三级域阶梯：Wikipedia(1) < C4(2) < arXiv(3)\n- **Web text K*=2 是 dominant mode**（7/8 configurations），展现跨模型架构、跨解码策略的一致性\n- **Structured academic text (arXiv) K*=3**，经五个模型配置、四个架构族 cross-validate（Qwen-1.5B, Qwen-7B, Pythia-1.4B, LLaMA-8B, Mistral-7B; 5/5 domain-competent models, 100%）\n- **Wikipedia K*=1 (scorer-controlled)**：全部 6 个模型在 cross-family scorer 控制后均 K*=1。Qwen 生成器在 same-family scorer 下的 K*=2 是 scorer family bias artifact（D060 确认），正文报告 scorer-controlled 值，Appendix 披露 confound 细节\n- **Mistral-7B K*=1 on C4 but K*=3 on arXiv**：domain-specific one-wash，最强 domain dependence 证据\n- **Domain 是 K* 的唯一主导因素**：scorer control 后，model scale/architecture/decoding strategy 均不改变域内 K* 一致性\n- **One-wash laundering effect**：对 web text 和 Wikipedia，单次生成即令文本与更深层合成内容不可区分\n\n**子组件：**\n\n**(a) K*=2 as dominant mode for web text (7/8 configurations)**\n> **7/8 model configurations yield K*=2 on C4 web text：**\n>\n> | Model | Experiment | AUC 1v2 | 95% CI | CI lower > 0.60? |\n> |-------|-----------|---------|--------|-----------------|\n> | Qwen-1.5B-Instruct rewrite | mvp-001 | 0.6957 | [0.6859, 0.7041] | ✅ (+8.6pp) |\n> | Pythia-1.4B cont | exp-001 | 0.6539 | [0.6454, 0.6630] | ✅ (+4.5pp) |\n> | Qwen-1.5B base cont | exp-016 | 0.6262 | [0.6168, 0.6353] | ✅ (+1.7pp) |\n> | Qwen2.5-7B cont | exp-004 | 0.6178 | [0.6079, 0.6261] | ✅ (+0.79pp) |\n> | OLMo-1B cont | exp-002 | 0.6145 | [0.6045, 0.6247] | ✅ (+0.45pp) |\n> | LLaMA-3.1-8B cont | exp-018 | 0.6123 | [0.6028, 0.6216] | ✅ (+0.28pp) |\n> | Qwen-1.5B-Instruct cont | exp-017 | 0.6112 | [0.6015, 0.6213] | ✅ (+0.15pp) |\n>\n> *Exception: Mistral-7B cont (exp-019): 1v2=0.5935, CI [0.5835, 0.6032], K*=1*\n>\n> *Decoding strategy invariance (exp-003):*\n> | Decoding | AUC 1v2 | K* |\n> |----------|---------|-----|\n> | greedy | 0.6893 | 2 |\n> | nucleus p=0.9 | 0.6866 | 2 |\n> | temp=0.7 | 0.6887 | 2 |\n> | temp=1.2 | 0.7039 | 2 |\n>\n> - 7/8 configurations 1v2 CI lower > 0.60, 全部 2v3 CI upper < 0.60\n> - 4 decoding strategies AUC 1v2 range [0.6866, 0.7039], K* 完全不变\n> - ⚠️ Qwen-cont 1v2 CI lower=0.6015 极边缘；cross-scorer validation 下降至 K*=1\n> - ⚠️ θ-sensitivity: θ=0.60 下 7/8 K*=2; θ=0.70 下多数降至 K*=1\n> - Paper 措辞：\"K*=2 emerges as the dominant mode for general web text (7/8 model configurations), demonstrating consistency across diverse architectures and decoding strategies.\"\n\n**(b) Domain dependence: arXiv K*=3 (5-model cross-validated, D055/D056/D057)**\n> - **Qwen-1.5B on arXiv** (exp-024): 2v3 AUC=0.6427, CI [0.6275, 0.6575], K*=3 ✅ (+2.75pp)\n> - **Pythia-1.4B on arXiv** (exp-025): 2v3 AUC=0.6544, CI [0.6401, 0.6688], K*=3 ✅ (+4.01pp)\n> - **LLaMA-3.1-8B on arXiv** (exp_arXiv_llama8b): 2v3 AUC=0.6215, K*=3 ✅ (+2.15pp)\n> - **Mistral-7B on arXiv** (exp_arXiv_mistral7b): 2v3 AUC=0.6275, all folds > 0.60, K*=3 ✅ (+2.75pp)\n> - **Qwen-7B on arXiv** (exp_arXiv_qwen7b): 2v3 AUC=0.6255, all folds > 0.60, K*=3 ✅ (+2.55pp)\n> - 五个模型配置、四个架构族（1.4B-8B）在 arXiv 上 100% 一致 K*=3（5/5 domain-competent models，仅 OLMo capacity failure）\n> - OLMo-1B K*=1 (exp_arXiv_olmo): capacity failure — 生成完全出域文本，不影响 domain property claim，作为 \"domain competence prerequisite\" 分析放 Appendix\n> - **Mistral C4 K*=1 → arXiv K*=3 是 domain dependence 的最强证据**：同一模型在不同域给出不同 K*，证明 K* 由 domain structure 主导而非 model identity\n> - **解释**：arXiv 的结构化特征（LaTeX formatting, citation patterns, mathematical notation）提供额外 depth-distinguishing signal，使辨别力多延伸一代\n> - Sample size: n=2,200 per model\n> - ⚠️ LLaMA fold 0=0.5969 < θ, bootstrap CI lower 可能接近 0.60 边界。论文措辞用 \"K*=3 with boundary pair AUC of 0.62\" 而非 \"robustly K*=3\"\n> - 论文定位：**domain dependence 是核心发现**——K* 由源文本结构复杂度决定，非纯模型属性。4-model cross-validation 大幅强化证据链\n\n**(c) Mistral K*=1 on web text: domain-specific one-wash (D056)**\n> - Mistral-7B 在 C4 web text 上 1v2 AUC CI lower < 0.60, K*=1\n> - Cross-scorer validation (exp-022): 使用其他模型 score Mistral 生成的文本，K*=1 maintained → C4 上的 K*=1 是 text-intrinsic（非 scorer artifact）\n> - **但 Mistral arXiv K*=3 (exp_arXiv_mistral7b) 证明 one-wash 是 domain-specific 而非 model-intrinsic**\n> - **One-wash laundering**：对 web text 这类 homogeneous 域，Mistral 单次生成即令文本在统计上不可区分于更深层合成；但 structured domains (arXiv) 能 rescue even Mistral from one-wash\n> - 论文定位：Mistral C4→arXiv 的 K* 跃变（1→3）是 (model × domain) interaction 的典型案例，进一步证明 domain structure 是 K* 的主要决定因素\n\n**(d) Cross-model transfer (scorer invariance)**\n> - Pythia↔OLMo 90-92% accuracy retention → K* 不是 model self-familiarity artifact\n> - 0v1 AUC > 0.96 across all transfer pairs → binary contamination signal 完全跨模型可迁移\n> - Cross-scorer validation (exp-022): 11/12 generator×scorer combos yield K*=2 → K* governed by generation process, not scoring model\n> - Feature ordering: scorer-invariant Spearman ρ > 0.90\n> - 论文定位：confirms K* is a property of the text/generation process, not the measurement apparatus\n\n**(e) Representation dependence of K* (Neural Probe)**\n> - exp-015 完整 3 模型结果（frozen self-embeddings + MLP probe）:\n>   - Qwen-cont: K*(neural)=3, 2v3 AUC=0.6159, CI [0.6099, 0.6223], CI lower > 0.60 ✅\n>   - Pythia-1.4B: K*(neural)=2, 2v3 AUC=0.5963, CI [0.5892, 0.6033], CI lower < 0.60 ❌\n>   - OLMo-1B: K*(neural)=2, 2v3 AUC=0.5892, CI [0.5818, 0.5965], CI lower < 0.60 ❌\n> - K*(neural) 是 model-dependent：Qwen K*=3, Pythia/OLMo K*=2\n> - 15D model-free features 给出一致的 K* across all models，neural probe 给出 model-dependent K*\n> - Interpretability-deployability tradeoff: model-free features 的 universality 优势在 cross-model 结果下更明显\n> - 论文定位：validates choice of model-free 15D features for headline characterization\n\n**(f) Generation mode analysis (§4.x Analysis subsection)**\n> - Signal strength: rewrite AUC 1v2=0.6957 vs continuation 0.6114（Δ=+8.4pp）\n> - Transferability: continuation 80-92% retention vs rewrite 61-63%\n> - Feature subset: cont→rw 89% > rw→cont 82% → continuation features 是 rewrite 的通用子集\n> - Interpretation: rewrite mode 的 instruction-following 引入 mode-specific style artifacts，放大 depth signal 但降低跨模型泛化性\n> - 论文定位：Analysis subsection，不是独立 claim\n\n### Secondary: C3 (K*-Aware Data Curation Validation)\nDomain-appropriate K* correctly predicts optimal curation granularity: for web text (K*=2), binary K*-aware filtering (0.5941 MMLU) outperforms graduated depth weighting (best 0.5892 at α=0.9), surprisal-based selection (0.5894), and DSIR distribution matching (~0.5867, ≈ no-filter level). Dose-response analysis (exp-009 v3, 3 ratios × 3 strategies × 5 seeds) confirms binary filtering maintains consistent advantage across 10%/30%/50% contamination ratios (HellaSwag significantly better at all levels, p≤0.004), while graduated filtering collapses to no-filter baseline performance. K* serves as an actionable curation guideline: the domain-dependent discrimination boundary directly determines the optimal filtering granularity.\n\n> ⚠️ Defensive framing constraint (D053): MMLU at 30% ratio p=0.074 不显著, 不能 claim \"universally beneficial\"。维持 \"consistent advantage\" 措辞，以 HellaSwag 显著性为主要证据。\n\n### Supporting Analysis: Canonical Condition Selection\nGeneration mode 是 depth estimation 的显著混淆变量。Methodology 段落阐述 continuation mode 作为 canonical condition 的选择及理由（不作为独立 claim）。\n\n## Story Spine\n\n- **Problem**: Web 数据正被多代递归合成文本污染。当前检测方法将合成文本视为 binary 类别（real vs synthetic），但质量随代际深度非线性退化——首代合成文本与四代合成文本的质量差异巨大却被忽视。\n- **Existing approaches & gaps**: Binary detectors (DivEye, Min-K%++) 不区分代际；model collapse 文献 (Shumailov et al., Alemohammad et al. 2024, Dohmatob et al. 2024) 描述宏观现象但不提供检测工具；data selection methods (DSIR, D4, DoReMi) 做分布匹配但不估计递归深度；Drayson et al. (2025) 将 binary MGT detection 应用于 importance resampling 以防止 model collapse，是目前最接近的工作。然而这些方法均做二值判断，**不估计文本经历了多少轮递归生成，也不量化辨别能力的饱和边界。**\n- **Our framing**: 将递归生成建模为 iterated lossy channel，从信息论（DPI）推导出 K* 的必然存在。K* 是首次系统测量的 operational quantity——它告诉数据策展者\"在什么深度以下，depth-aware curation 比 binary detection 更有价值\"。通过 8 model configurations（5 architecture families, 1B-8B）、3 source domains、4 decoding strategies 系统表征 K*，揭示其 **bounded domain-dependent** 本质：**K*∈{1,2,3}**，形成清晰的三级域阶梯——Wikipedia K*=1（6 models, scorer-controlled），C4 web text K*=2（7/8 configurations），arXiv K*=3（5/5 domain-competent models, 4 architecture families）。Domain 是 K* 的唯一主导因素：scorer confound 控制后，model identity/scale/decoding strategy 均不改变域内一致性。这一发现意味着递归生成信息丧失极快——one to two generation passes suffice to erase distinguishable depth structure（\"one-wash laundering\" effect）。Domain dependence 为数据治理提供 actionable guidance：源文本的结构复杂度决定了 depth-aware filtering 的适用粒度。\n- **Headline result template**: \"Recursive generation has a bounded discrimination boundary at K*∈{1,2,3}, forming a three-level domain hierarchy: Wikipedia saturates at K*=1 (all 6 models, scorer-controlled), web text at K*=2 (7/8 model configurations, 5 architecture families, 1B-8B), and structured academic text extends to K*=3 (cross-validated across 5 models, 4 architecture families). Domain structural complexity is the sole systematic determinant of K*. Cross-model transfer retention of 80-92% and scorer-invariant feature ordering (ρ>0.90) confirm depth features are text-intrinsic. Domain-appropriate K* correctly predicts optimal curation granularity.\"\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Responses\n\n1. **\"K*∈{1,2,3} 范围太小，结论是否 trivial？\"** → 恰好相反：K* 的低有界性是核心发现。DPI 理论只保证 K* 有限但不给上界；我们首次实证表明 K*≤3（即递归信息丧失极快），且 domain dependence 揭示了结构化文本如何延缓信息退化。One-wash laundering effect 对 data governance 有直接实践意义。\n2. **\"只基于小模型（≤8B），能推广到更大模型吗？\"** → 5 architecture families (1B-8B) 覆盖了当前开源生态的主要架构。DPI 理论保证 K*_theory 对任意规模模型存在。Cross-scorer validation 表明 K* 由生成过程而非评分模型决定。扩展至 13B+/70B+ 是重要 future work。\n3. **\"只是 feature engineering + off-the-shelf classifier，方法贡献弱\"** → 贡献在 problem formulation + empirical characterization（首次测量 K*）+ 理论框架（DPI）+ domain-dependent bounded saturation 发现，不是分类器本身。Model-free features 的选择被 cross-model transfer 80-92% 和 scorer invariance 验证为正确设计。\n4. **\"arXiv K*=3 样本量够吗？\"** → 五个模型（Qwen-1.5B, Qwen-7B, Pythia-1.4B, LLaMA-8B, Mistral-7B）跨四个架构族均给出 K*=3，每模型 n=2,200，bootstrap CI 确认统计显著。5/5 domain-competent models 100% 一致性排除 model-specific artifact。\n5. **\"Mistral K*=1 是 outlier 还是 systematic？\"** → Cross-scorer validation 确认是 text-intrinsic（非 scorer artifact）。Mistral 可能因训练数据/alignment 差异导致生成文本在一代后即失去 depth-distinguishing structure。这强化了 domain/model dependence 的核心论点。\n6. **\"Prompt-chain 不代表真实世界递归污染\"** → Prompt-chain 隔离纯文本退化效应（text-intrinsic degradation），是更 generalizable 的实验设计。**exp-008 实证验证**：retrain-chain (Pythia-1.4B LoRA) K*≥4（1v2=0.9484, 2v3=0.8888, 3v4=0.7982），远高于 prompt-chain K*=2。原因：LoRA fine-tune 每代引入累积模型 artifacts（vocabulary narrowing, repetition bias），使各代高度可区分。这些 model-adaptation artifacts 是 setup-specific 的，不泛化到 wild contamination scenarios。因此 prompt-chain K*=2 是 data curation 的 operational boundary（仅反映 text-intrinsic information loss），而非 retrain-chain 的 upper bound。\n7. **\"同模型做生成和 surprisal 计算有 bias\"** → **exp-013/exp-022 直接反驳**：cross-scorer validation 11/12 combos yield K*=2, Pythia↔OLMo 90-92% accuracy retention。K* governed by generation process, not scoring model。**D060 进一步证实**：Wikipedia 上 Qwen same-family scorer 的 +1 bias 被 Pythia cross-family scorer 消除（K*=2→1），证明 scorer confound 可被检测和控制，且仅影响特定 model-family×domain 组合（不影响 C4 主线结论）。\n8. **\"为什么不用 learned representations\"** → **exp-015 直接回应**：neural probe K* 是 model-dependent（Qwen=3, Pythia/OLMo=2），而 15D model-free features 给出一致的 K* across all models。Model-free 方案的 universality + cross-model transferability 是 practical advantage。\n9. **\"θ=0.60 选择是否 arbitrary？\"** → 三层辩护：(1) Cohen's h≈0.20 small effect size threshold, (2) permutation test 校准, (3) AUC gap 在 boundary 处的 sharp discontinuity（1v2 vs 2v3 gap 大于 θ 选择的 sensitivity range）。θ-sensitivity analysis [0.55, 0.70] 在主文呈现。\n10. **\"Graduated filtering 没和 data selection methods 比\"** → exp-006 包含 DSIR baseline + α sensitivity sweep，binary K*-aware filtering outperforms all tested alternatives。\n\n## Venue Fit\n\n- EMNLP 2026 special theme 明确呼吁 data contamination, synthetic data feedback loops, data governance 方向的工作\n- 2+1 claim 结构：C1' 是 comprehensive characterization study with domain-dependent bounded saturation finding，C3 是 practical application，generation mode analysis 增加深度\n- **Domain-dependent bounded saturation narrative** 比 universality 更准确且更有 impact：K*∈{1,2,3} 的 bounded range + domain dependence 是 nuanced scientific finding，比 \"K*=2 everywhere\" 更可信且更 interesting（审稿人不必怀疑过度外推）\n- One-wash laundering effect 是 memorable concept 便于传播\n- 风险：K* range 小（1-3）可能被认为 trivial → 论文须强调 bounded ≤3 本身是 surprising（DPI 不给上界），且 domain dependence 是 actionable（不同域需不同 curation 策略）\n","numLines":151,"startLine":1,"totalLines":151}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MTF3izd3anArQT6XV64wPn","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"mvp-001\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct rewrite mode pilot, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"k_star\": 2,\n7\t      \"pairwise_auc_0v1\": 0.9956,\n8\t      \"pairwise_auc_1v2\": 0.6957,\n9\t      \"pairwise_auc_2v3\": 0.5893,\n10\t      \"pairwise_auc_3v4\": 0.5434,\n11\t      \"pairwise_auc_4v5\": 0.5343,\n12\t      \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.4182,\n13\t      \"ordinal_mae\": 1.0163\n14\t    },\n15\t    \"tables\": [\n16\t      {\n17\t        \"name\": \"Table 1 (partial): Pairwise AUC — MVP pilot\",\n18\t        \"content\": \"| Pair | AUC    | 95% CI           | > θ=0.60? |\\n|------|--------|------------------|-----------|\\n| 0v1  | 0.9956 | [0.9946, 0.9965] | ✅ (+39.5pp) |\\n| 1v2  | 0.6957 | [0.6859, 0.7041] | ✅ (+8.6pp)  |\\n| 2v3  | 0.5893 | [0.5795, 0.5991] | ❌           |\\n| 3v4  | 0.5434 | [0.5333, 0.5551] | ❌           |\\n| 4v5  | 0.5343 | [0.5238, 0.5448] | ❌           |\\n\"\n19\t      }\n20\t    ],\n21\t    \"figures\": [],\n22\t    \"analysis\": \"Reviewer A 接受 rewrite mode 作为 pilot 合理。Reviewer B 质疑为何论文早期版本以 rewrite AUC  (0.6957) 为 headline 而非 continuation (0.6114)——存在 cherry-picking 嫌疑。 Median 档下需在论文中明确标注 mvp-001 为 pilot，所有 figure 和 headline number 基于 continuation mode。\\n\\n\\nRewrite mode 因 instruction-following 引入 mode-specific style artifacts，放大 depth signal 至 1v2 AUC=0.6957。 在 median 档下，1-2 个 reviewer 注意到 rewrite mode 的高 AUC 不能代表 canonical condition， 要求论文明确将此实验定位为 \\\"pilot study demonstrating feasibility\\\"。2v3=0.5893 < θ=0.60  确认 K*=2，但 reviewer 指出 rewrite mode 的 signal amplification 使 K*=2 判定比 continuation  更容易，质疑是否该用 rewrite 的高 AUC 作为 headline number。 Median 档 reviewer 接受此实验作为 motivation，但要求所有 cross-model claims 基于 continuation mode。\\n\"\n23\t  },\n24\t  {\n25\t    \"name\": \"exp-001\",\n26\t    \"description\": \"Pythia-1.4B, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\",\n27\t    \"results\": {\n28\t      \"k_star\": 2,\n29\t      \"pairwise_auc_0v1\": 0.9932,\n30\t      \"pairwise_auc_1v2\": 0.6539,\n31\t      \"pairwise_auc_2v3\": 0.5515,\n32\t      \"pairwise_auc_3v4\": 0.5153,\n33\t      \"pairwise_auc_4v5\": 0.5135,\n34\t      \"ci_1v2_lower\": 0.6454,\n35\t      \"ci_1v2_upper\": 0.663,\n36\t      \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.383,\n37\t      \"ordinal_mae\": 1.14\n38\t    },\n39\t    \"tables\": [\n40\t      {\n41\t        \"name\": \"Table 2 (row): Pythia-1.4B C4 continuation\",\n42\t        \"content\": \"| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | 3v4 | 4v5 | K* |\\n|-------|------|------|------|------|------|----|\\n| Pythia-1.4B | 0.993 | 0.654 | 0.552 | 0.515 | 0.514 | 2 |\\n\"\n43\t      }\n44\t    ],\n45\t    \"figures\": [],\n46\t    \"analysis\": \"稳健但不 exciting。Median 档 reviewer 视为 \\\"solid but incremental evidence for a somewhat  expected finding\\\"。Pythia 的较高 1v2 AUC (vs Qwen-cont 0.6112) 减少了 borderline concern， 但也没有超出 reviewer 的信息论直觉预期。\\n\\n\\nPythia-1.4B 作为第一个 continuation mode 跨模型验证，1v2 AUC=0.6539 距 θ=0.60 有 +4.5pp 余量， 是 C4 web text 上 K*=2 的稳健证据。2v3 AUC=0.5515 远低于 θ，sharp boundary 明确。 在 median 档下，reviewer 接受 Pythia 的 K*=2 判定没有争议（CI lower=0.6454 >> 0.60）， 但指出 Pythia-1.4B 作为较老架构，代表性受限——单独一个模型不足以 claim universality。 Reviewer 认为此结果 \\\"expected given information-theoretic intuition\\\"（A1 假设）， 递归生成必然快速退化是直觉上合理的，K*=2 不算 surprising。\\n\"\n47\t  },\n48\t  {\n49\t    \"name\": \"exp-002\",\n50\t    \"description\": \"OLMo-1B, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\",\n51\t    \"results\": {\n52\t      \"k_star\": 2,\n53\t      \"pairwise_auc_0v1\": 0.997,\n54\t      \"pairwise_auc_1v2\": 0.6146,\n55\t      \"pairwise_auc_2v3\": 0.5497,\n56\t      \"pairwise_auc_3v4\": 0.509,\n57\t      \"pairwise_auc_4v5\": 0.5044,\n58\t      \"ci_1v2_lower\": 0.6045,\n59\t      \"ci_1v2_upper\": 0.6247,\n60\t      \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.3685,\n61\t      \"ordinal_mae\": 1.1813\n62\t    },\n63\t    \"tables\": [\n64\t      {\n65\t        \"name\": \"Table 2 (row): OLMo-1B C4 continuation\",\n66\t        \"content\": \"| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | 3v4 | 4v5 | K* |\\n|-------|------|------|------|------|------|----|\\n| OLMo-1B | 0.997 | 0.615 | 0.550 | 0.509 | 0.504 | 2 |\\n\"\n67\t      }\n68\t    ],\n69\t    \"figures\": [],\n70\t    \"analysis\": \"与 Pythia 一致，增强跨模型证据。OLMo 3v4/4v5 接近 0.50 (chance)， 进一步确认 depth ≥3 后信号完全消失。Reviewer 不质疑此具体结果。\\n\\n\\nOLMo-1B 1v2 AUC=0.6146，CI lower=0.6045，余量 +0.45pp。比 Pythia 更边缘但仍 pass。 Median 档下 reviewer 注意到 OLMo 的 CI lower 只比 θ 高 0.45pp，但未被单独点名 （Qwen-cont 的 0.6015 更 marginal 所以吸引了注意力）。 OLMo 1v2=0.6146 和 Pythia 1v2=0.6539 的差异暗示 model 确实对 signal strength 有影响， 但两者 K* 一致=2，支持 \\\"domain is primary determinant\\\" 的 claim。 Reviewer 接受 Pythia↔OLMo 的一致性但指出只有两个 continuation mode 模型在此阶段不够。\\n\"\n71\t  },\n72\t  {\n73\t    \"name\": \"exp-003\",\n74\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-1.5B decoding strategy ablation: greedy / nucleus p=0.9 / T=0.7 / T=1.2\",\n75\t    \"results\": {\n76\t      \"k_star\": 2,\n77\t      \"k_star_robust\": true,\n78\t      \"greedy_1v2_auc\": 0.6892,\n79\t      \"nuc09_1v2_auc\": 0.6862,\n80\t      \"t07_1v2_auc\": 0.6885,\n81\t      \"t12_1v2_auc\": 0.7037,\n82\t      \"auc_1v2_range\": \"[0.6862, 0.7037]\",\n83\t      \"all_k_star_2\": true,\n84\t      \"nuc09_2v3_ci_upper\": 0.601\n85\t    },\n86\t    \"tables\": [\n87\t      {\n88\t        \"name\": \"Table 3: Decoding strategy ablation\",\n89\t        \"content\": \"| Decoding | 0v1 AUC | 1v2 AUC | 2v3 AUC | K* |\\n|----------|---------|---------|---------|-----|\\n| greedy   | 0.9796  | 0.6892  | 0.5612  | 2   |\\n| nucleus p=0.9 | 0.9945 | 0.6862 | 0.5917 | 2 |\\n| T=0.7    | 0.9877  | 0.6885  | 0.5901  | 2   |\\n| T=1.2    | 0.9982  | 0.7037  | 0.5820  | 2   |\\n\"\n90\t      }\n91\t    ],\n92\t    \"figures\": [],\n93\t    \"analysis\": \"Decoding invariance 是 C1' 的重要支柱。Median 档 reviewer 接受此结论但权重较低 （\\\"somewhat expected — decoding shouldn't change fundamental information loss\\\"）。 exp-020 在 Pythia continuation 上的 replication 增强了此证据。\\n\\n\\n四种解码策略下 K* 完全一致=2，AUC range < 2pp。这是 median 档下 reviewer 较认可的证据—— 解码策略不变性消除了 \\\"K*=2 是特定 sampling 参数的 artifact\\\" 的质疑。 但 nuc09 2v3 CI upper=0.601 接触 θ=0.60 边界，被注意但未被重点攻击（因为是 CI upper 而非 lower）。 Reviewer 注意到此实验仅在 Qwen rewrite mode 上做（后 exp-020 在 Pythia 上复制）， rewrite mode 的 higher baseline signal 使 K*=2 更容易 robust， 需要 continuation mode 上同样的 ablation 来增强说服力。\\n\"\n94\t  },\n95\t  {\n96\t    \"name\": \"exp-004\",\n97\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-7B, continuation mode, C4 5K docs, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\",\n98\t    \"results\": {\n99\t      \"k_star\": 2,\n100\t      \"pairwise_auc_1v2\": 0.6178,\n101\t      \"ci_1v2_lower\": 0.6079,\n102\t      \"ci_1v2_upper\": 0.6261,\n103\t      \"pairwise_auc_2v3\": 0.546,\n104\t      \"ci_2v3_upper\": 0.5594,\n105\t      \"pairwise_auc_4v5_perm_p\": 0.0676\n106\t    },\n107\t    \"tables\": [\n108\t      {\n109\t        \"name\": \"Table 2 (row): Qwen2.5-7B C4 continuation\",\n110\t        \"content\": \"| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | 3v4 | 4v5 | K* |\\n|-------|------|------|------|------|------|----|\\n| Qwen2.5-7B | 0.964 | 0.618 | 0.546 | 0.523 | 0.509 | 2 |\\n\"\n111\t      }\n112\t    ],\n113\t    \"figures\": [],\n114\t    \"analysis\": \"Scale invariance (1.5B→7B) 被 1 个 reviewer 认为是 \\\"weak evidence for scale generalization\\\"。 Rebuttal 需要 14B/32B 数据。exp_14b_c4 (K*=2) 已可用但 exp_32b_c4 仍在跑。 如果 32B 也给 K*=2，可在 rebuttal 中有效回应 A3。\\n\\n\\n7B scale 下 K*=2 与 1.5B 一致，CI lower=0.6079 > θ（余量 +0.79pp）。 在 median 档下，reviewer 接受 1.5B→7B 的 scale invariance 但力度不足： (a) 只从 1.5B 到 7B 不算大幅 scale-up；(b) A3 假设被触发——至少一个 reviewer  标记 \\\"≤8B is a significant limitation, need 13B+ evidence\\\"。 4v5 pair p=0.0676 non-significant，被 reviewer 视为 \\\"depth ≥4 信号消失的进一步证据\\\"， 有利于 K*=2 的 claim。但 reviewer 质疑：如果更大模型（70B）生成更高质量文本， K* 可能增加——作者需要 theoretically argue 或 empirically show 这一点。\\n\"\n115\t  },\n116\t  {\n117\t    \"name\": \"exp-005\",\n118\t    \"description\": \"Feature group ablation + degradation ordering analysis\",\n119\t    \"results\": {\n120\t      \"cross_model_spearman_rho_pythia_olmo\": 0.95,\n121\t      \"cross_model_spearman_rho_pythia_qwen_cont\": 0.9143,\n122\t      \"cross_model_spearman_rho_olmo_qwen_cont\": 0.85,\n123\t      \"shared_top_discriminators\": \"surp_d1_std, surp_std, surp_d2_std\",\n124\t      \"1v2_tau_weakness\": \"~0.37\"\n125\t    },\n126\t    \"tables\": [\n127\t      {\n128\t        \"name\": \"Table A2: Cross-model feature ranking Spearman ρ\",\n129\t        \"content\": \"| Model Pair | Spearman ρ |\\n|------------|-----------|\\n| Pythia ↔ OLMo | 0.950 |\\n| Pythia ↔ Qwen-cont | 0.914 |\\n| OLMo ↔ Qwen-cont | 0.850 |\\n\"\n130\t      }\n131\t    ],\n132\t    \"figures\": [],\n133\t    \"analysis\": \"Supporting evidence for text-intrinsic signal。不构成独立卖点但消除 \\\"model self-familiarity\\\" 质疑。 Median 档下这个实验的贡献被 reviewer 归入 \\\"thorough analysis\\\" 而非 novel finding。\\n\\n\\nFeature ordering 跨模型高度一致（ρ≥0.85），支持 depth signal 是 text-intrinsic 而非 model-specific。 Median 档下 reviewer 接受 feature ranking consistency 但不视为独立贡献—— \\\"Feature analysis is supportive but expected if the underlying signal is text-intrinsic.\\\" 1v2 pair 的 feature importance 一致性最弱（τ~0.37），被 reviewer 注意但不重点攻击 （因为这恰好是 boundary pair，信号最微弱处 variance 大是合理的）。 Surprisal-based features 主导的发现与 DPI 理论一致，被 reviewer 视为 \\\"expected alignment\\\"。\\n\"\n134\t  },\n135\t  {\n136\t    \"name\": \"exp-006\",\n137\t    \"description\": \"Downstream filtering evaluation: 6 strategies × 5 seeds, MMLU + HellaSwag\",\n138\t    \"results\": {\n139\t      \"binary_ours_mmlu\": \"0.5941±0.0008\",\n140\t      \"binary_ours_hellaswag\": \"0.6701±0.0006\",\n141\t      \"no_filter_mmlu\": \"0.5865±0.0010\",\n142\t      \"no_filter_hellaswag\": \"0.6638±0.0008\",\n143\t      \"delta_mmlu_binary_vs_nofilter\": \"+0.0076\",\n144\t      \"delta_hellaswag_binary_vs_nofilter\": \"+0.0063\",\n145\t      \"base_model_mmlu\": 0.6018,\n146\t      \"graduated_a09_mmlu\": \"0.5892±0.0008\",\n147\t      \"dsir_mmlu\": \"0.5869±0.0003\"\n148\t    },\n149\t    \"tables\": [\n150\t      {\n151\t        \"name\": \"Table 5: Filtering strategy comparison (Qwen2.5-1.5B, 30% contamination)\",\n152\t        \"content\": \"| Strategy | MMLU | HellaSwag | Δ MMLU vs no-filter |\\n|----------|------|-----------|-------------------|\\n| binary-ours | 0.5941±0.0008 | 0.6701±0.0006 | +0.0076* |\\n| binary-Drayson | 0.5913±0.0009 | 0.6691±0.0004 | +0.0048* |\\n| surprisal | 0.5894±0.0009 | 0.6641±0.0006 | +0.0029 |\\n| graduated α=0.9 | 0.5892±0.0008 | 0.6701±0.0007 | +0.0027 |\\n| DSIR | 0.5869±0.0003 | 0.6631±0.0007 | +0.0004 |\\n| no-filter | 0.5865±0.0010 | 0.6638±0.0008 | — |\\n| base (no contam.) | 0.6018 | 0.6821 | — |\\n\"\n153\t      }\n154\t    ],\n155\t    \"figures\": [],\n156\t    \"analysis\": \"Median 档 reviewer 给 C3 的 substance score ~2.5-3.0。核心攻击点： 1. Effect size 太小（<1pp MMLU）不够 actionable 2. Binary > graduated 说明 K* boundary 信息对 curation 有用，但增益微小 3. 所有策略 degrade vs base_model 暗示 filtering 的 ceiling 低 C3 需要从 \\\"validation\\\" 降级为 \\\"case study / demonstration\\\"。\\n\\n\\nBinary-ours 在所有策略中最优，但 MMLU 增益仅 +0.76pp vs no-filter。 在 median 档下，这是 C3 的核心弱点（A5_fail）： (a) MMLU Δ=0.76pp 被 reviewer 质疑 practical significance——\\\"Is <1pp improvement  worth the curation complexity?\\\" (b) 所有策略都 degrade vs base_model（0.6018→0.5941），说明 contaminated data 的  fundamental harm 无法被 filtering 完全消除 (c) Graduated α 单调递增确认 K*=2 boundary，但 reviewer 指出这是 circular reasoning—— 用 K* 设计 filtering 然后用 filtering 验证 K* (d) DSIR 表现差（接近 no-filter）是一个正面结果，但 reviewer 质疑 DSIR baseline  的公平性（DSIR 不是为 depth-aware filtering 设计的）\\n\"\n157\t  },\n158\t  {\n159\t    \"name\": \"exp-007\",\n160\t    \"description\": \"K* sensitivity at θ=0.55/0.60/0.65/0.70 + bootstrap CI + permutation test\",\n161\t    \"results\": {\n162\t      \"all_1v2_ci_lower_above_060\": true,\n163\t      \"most_marginal\": \"Qwen-cont CI lower=0.6015\",\n164\t      \"theta_055_k_star_distribution\": \"all models K*=2 or K*=3\",\n165\t      \"theta_060_k_star_distribution\": \"7/8 K*=2, 1/8 K*=1 (Mistral)\",\n166\t      \"theta_065_k_star_distribution\": \"4-5/8 K*=2, rest K*=1\",\n167\t      \"theta_070_k_star_distribution\": \"most K*=1\"\n168\t    },\n169\t    \"tables\": [\n170\t      {\n171\t        \"name\": \"Table 4: K* sensitivity to threshold θ\",\n172\t        \"content\": \"| θ | K*=1 | K*=2 | K*=3 |\\n|------|------|------|------|\\n| 0.55 | 0/8  | 7/8  | 1/8  |\\n| 0.60 | 1/8  | 7/8  | 0/8  |\\n| 0.65 | 3-4/8 | 4-5/8 | 0/8 |\\n| 0.70 | 6-7/8 | 1-2/8 | 0/8 |\\n\"\n173\t      }\n174\t    ],\n175\t    \"figures\": [],\n176\t    \"analysis\": \"θ-sensitivity 被 median 档 reviewer 视为 \\\"fair analysis\\\" 但 robustness concern 未完全消除。 关键辩护：θ=0.60 对应 Cohen's h≈0.20（small effect size threshold）， 且 1v2 vs 2v3 的 AUC gap 远大于 θ 选择的 sensitivity range。 Reviewer 接受 [0.55, 0.65] 稳定性但仍认为 \\\"the result is more about where you draw the line  than about the underlying phenomenon\\\"。\\n\\n\\nθ-sensitivity 是 median 档的关键攻击面（A6_partial）。 θ=0.60 下 7/8 configurations K*=2 被接受，但 θ=0.70 下多数降至 K*=1 被 reviewer 放大—— \\\"The finding is highly sensitive to threshold choice. At θ=0.70, the headline result  (K*=2 as dominant mode) collapses.\\\" Qwen-cont CI lower=0.6015 被 A8_attacked 假设触发——reviewer 要求 sensitivity analysis  或额外 seeds 来确认这不是 noise。 论文需要在主文（非 appendix）展示 θ-sensitivity figure，正面呈现 K* 在 [0.55, 0.65]  范围内的稳定性，并以 Cohen's h=0.20 和 AUC gap discontinuity 为 θ=0.60 选择辩护。 Permutation test p<0.001 对所有 boundary pairs 提供统计支持，但 reviewer 指出  \\\"statistical significance ≠ practical significance at these effect sizes\\\"。\\n\"\n177\t  },\n178\t  {\n179\t    \"name\": \"exp-008\",\n180\t    \"description\": \"Retrain-chain ecological validity: Pythia-1.4B LoRA, C4 5K docs, depth 0-4\",\n181\t    \"results\": {\n182\t      \"k_star\": \">=4\",\n183\t      \"pairwise_auc_0v1\": 0.9847,\n184\t      \"pairwise_auc_1v2\": 0.9484,\n185\t      \"pairwise_auc_2v3\": 0.8888,\n186\t      \"pairwise_auc_3v4\": 0.7982\n187\t    },\n188\t    \"tables\": [\n189\t      {\n190\t        \"name\": \"Table 6: Prompt-chain vs Retrain-chain comparison\",\n191\t        \"content\": \"| Pair | Prompt-chain AUC | Retrain-chain AUC |\\n|------|-----------------|-------------------|\\n| 0v1  | 0.993 | 0.985 |\\n| 1v2  | 0.654 | 0.948 |\\n| 2v3  | 0.552 | 0.889 |\\n| 3v4  | 0.515 | 0.798 |\\n\"\n192\t      }\n193\t    ],\n194\t    \"figures\": [],\n195\t    \"analysis\": \"强有力的 supporting evidence。Median 档 reviewer 肯定此实验的 ecological validity 贡献， 但建议正文讨论 \\\"real-world contamination likely falls between prompt-chain and retrain-chain\\\"。\\n\\n\\nRetrain-chain K*≥4 与 prompt-chain K*=2 的对比是重要的 ecological validity argument。 LoRA fine-tune 每代引入 cumulative model artifacts（vocabulary narrowing, repetition bias）， 使各代高度可区分。Median 档下 reviewer 接受 \\\"prompt-chain isolates text-intrinsic degradation\\\"  的论点，但 1 个 reviewer 认为这说明 \\\"in practice, retrain-chain contamination is more  detectable, so K*=2 underestimates real-world detectability\\\"——这实际上对论文有利 （prompt-chain K*=2 是 conservative estimate），但 reviewer 的 framing 是  \\\"the paper should discuss this more prominently\\\"。 3v4 AUC=0.7982 远超 θ=0.60，所有 pairs 在 retrain-chain 下都高度可区分， 证明 K* 的低有界性是 prompt-chain (text-intrinsic) 特有的。\\n\"\n196\t  },\n197\t  {\n198\t    \"name\": \"exp-009\",\n199\t    \"description\": \"Contamination dose-response: 10%/30%/50% ratio × 3 strategies × 5 seeds\",\n200\t    \"results\": {\n201\t      \"binary_consistently_best\": true,\n202\t      \"graduated_equals_no_filter\": true,\n203\t      \"hellaswag_binary_significant_all_ratios\": true,\n204\t      \"mmlu_binary_30pct_p\": 0.074,\n205\t      \"effect_size_increases_with_contamination\": true\n206\t    },\n207\t    \"tables\": [\n208\t      {\n209\t        \"name\": \"Table 7: Dose-response analysis\",\n210\t        \"content\": \"| Ratio | Strategy | MMLU | HellaSwag |\\n|-------|----------|------|-----------|\\n| 10% | binary | 0.6079 | 0.6727** |\\n| 10% | graduated | 0.6066 | 0.6700 |\\n| 10% | no-filter | 0.6058 | 0.6689 |\\n| 30% | binary | 0.6082 | 0.6725** |\\n| 30% | graduated | 0.6072 | 0.6665 |\\n| 30% | no-filter | 0.6069 | 0.6664 |\\n| 50% | binary | 0.6088 | 0.6731** |\\n| 50% | graduated | 0.6062 | 0.6679 |\\n| 50% | no-filter | 0.6063 | 0.6680 |\\n\"\n211\t      }\n212\t    ],\n213\t    \"figures\": [],\n214\t    \"analysis\": \"Binary filtering 的 dose-response consistency 是 C3 的最强证据。 但 graduated=no-filter 的一致性同时说明 K*-aware graduated curation 无增量价值—— 这直接削弱了 \\\"K* informs curation granularity\\\" 的 narrative。 Median 档下 C3 的 reviewer 评分因此在 2.5-3.0 区间。\\n\\n\\nDose-response 确认 binary filtering 在所有 contamination ratio 下一致最优， graduated filtering 在每个 ratio 下都崩溃至 no-filter 水平。 在 median 档下： (a) HellaSwag 显著性是正面证据（p≤0.004 at all ratios） (b) MMLU 在 30% ratio 下 p=0.074 不显著——reviewer 注意到 \\\"inconsistent significance  across benchmarks weakens the claim\\\"（A5_fail 部分触发） (c) Effect size 随 contamination ratio 增加（10%: +0.38pp, 30%: +0.61pp, 50%: +0.51pp HellaSwag）， 但绝对值仍然小 (d) 一个 reviewer 肯定 dose-response 设计的 thoroughness，但另一个认为  \\\"50% synthetic injection is unrealistic for current web data\\\"\\n\"\n215\t  },\n216\t  {\n217\t    \"name\": \"exp-010\",\n218\t    \"description\": \"CORAL vs multiclass LightGBM vs ordinal logistic regression\",\n219\t    \"results\": {\n220\t      \"obd_lgbm_best_accuracy\": 0.4229,\n221\t      \"multiclass_lgbm_accuracy\": 0.4182,\n222\t      \"ordinal_logreg_best_tau\": 0.563,\n223\t      \"obd_lgbm_best_mae\": 0.9836\n224\t    },\n225\t    \"tables\": [\n226\t      {\n227\t        \"name\": \"Table A3: Classifier comparison\",\n228\t        \"content\": \"| Method | Acc | MAE | τ_b | Mean PW-AUC |\\n|--------|-----|-----|-----|-------------|\\n| OBD-LightGBM | 0.423 | 0.984 | 0.552 | 0.621 |\\n| Multiclass-LightGBM | 0.418 | 1.016 | 0.537 | 0.625 |\\n| Ordinal LogReg | 0.364 | 0.911 | 0.563 | 0.502 |\\n\"\n229\t      }\n230\t    ],\n231\t    \"figures\": [],\n232\t    \"analysis\": \"Appendix material。Median 档 reviewer 不质疑也不 highlight。\\n\\n\\nOBD-LightGBM 在 accuracy 和 mean_pw_auc 上略优于 multiclass LightGBM， 但差异小（Δacc < 0.5pp）。Ordinal logistic regression MAE 最低但 accuracy 最差。 Median 档下 reviewer 不特别关注此实验——它是 methodology 的 supporting evidence， 不构成独立卖点。Reviewer 认为 \\\"the choice between ordinal and multiclass classifiers  is an implementation detail, not a contribution\\\"。 但 ordinal structure 的存在（CORAL MAE < multiclass MAE across all models） 为论文的 \\\"depth is ordinal, not categorical\\\" framing 提供小幅支持。\\n\"\n233\t  },\n234\t  {\n235\t    \"name\": \"exp-011\",\n236\t    \"description\": \"GPT-5.5 / Claude Opus 4.6 zero-shot depth estimation baseline\",\n237\t    \"results\": {\n238\t      \"gpt55_5class_acc\": 0.332,\n239\t      \"claude_5class_acc\": 0.331,\n240\t      \"gpt55_binary_acc\": 0.878,\n241\t      \"claude_binary_acc\": 0.882,\n242\t      \"odb_baseline_5class_acc\": 0.386\n243\t    },\n244\t    \"tables\": [\n245\t      {\n246\t        \"name\": \"Table 8: LLM zero-shot vs OBD baseline\",\n247\t        \"content\": \"| Method | 5-class Acc | MAE | Binary Acc |\\n|--------|------------|-----|-----------|\\n| GPT-5.5 | 0.332 | 1.102 | 0.878 |\\n| Claude Opus 4.6 | 0.331 | 1.150 | 0.882 |\\n| OBD-LightGBM | 0.386 | 1.107 | — |\\n\"\n248\t      }\n249\t    ],\n250\t    \"figures\": [],\n251\t    \"analysis\": \"Median 档 reviewer 正面评价此 baseline，但 McNemar test non-significant (p~0.07-0.08)  被注意——\\\"The advantage of OBD over frontier LLMs is not statistically significant.\\\"\\n\\n\\nFrontier LLMs 在 5-class depth estimation 上表现不如 OBD-LightGBM（33% vs 39%）， 但 binary detection 高达 88%。这是一个 strong baseline comparison： (a) 证明 depth estimation 需要 specialized features，不能 \\\"throw LLM at it\\\" (b) Binary detection 高但 fine-grained depth 失败，支持 \\\"binary ≠ depth\\\" 的 claim Median 档下 reviewer 对此实验评价较正面——\\\"Good to include, demonstrates the problem  is not trivially solvable.\\\"但 1 个 reviewer 指出 OBD 也只有 39% accuracy， \\\"both methods are poor at fine-grained depth estimation, which raises the question  of whether depth estimation beyond K* is even meaningful\\\"。 这实际上对 K* characterization 有利（K* 之后的深度确实无法区分）， 但被 reviewer 解读为对整体 contribution 的 dampener。\\n\"\n252\t  },\n253\t  {\n254\t    \"name\": \"exp-012\",\n255\t    \"description\": \"DivEye/Binoculars binary detector confidence as depth proxy\",\n256\t    \"results\": {\n257\t      \"binary_detector_kstar\": 1,\n258\t      \"obd_kstar\": 2,\n259\t      \"spearman_rho_range\": \"0.06-0.46\",\n260\t      \"auc_non_monotonic\": true,\n261\t      \"six_class_accuracy_max\": 0.199\n262\t    },\n263\t    \"tables\": [\n264\t      {\n265\t        \"name\": \"Table A4: Binary detector depth estimation\",\n266\t        \"content\": \"| Generator | 6-class Acc | ρ (ppl_ratio) | AUC monotonic? |\\n|-----------|------------|--------------|---------------|\\n| Qwen-rw | 0.199 | 0.119 | ❌ |\\n| Pythia | 0.130 | -0.392 | ❌ |\\n| OLMo | 0.127 | -0.407 | ❌ |\\n| Qwen-cont | 0.183 | -0.058 | ❌ |\\n\"\n267\t      }\n268\t    ],\n269\t    \"figures\": [],\n270\t    \"analysis\": \"Strong justification for the paper's approach。Median 档下被 reviewer 正面引用。\\n\\n\\nBinary detectors K*≈1 vs OBD K*=2，6-class accuracy 接近 random（≤0.199 vs 0.167 random）。 Spearman correlation 弱且非单调。直接支持 \\\"binary confidence ≠ depth\\\" 的 claim。 Median 档下 reviewer 接受此结论——\\\"Well-designed experiment that justifies the need for  depth-aware features beyond binary detection.\\\" 不被特别攻击。 但 reviewer 注意到 DivEye/Binoculars 都是 perplexity-based， 建议加入 watermark-based 或 learned detectors 作为 baseline。论文无此 baseline  被视为 minor weakness 而非 major concern。\\n\"\n271\t  },\n272\t  {\n273\t    \"name\": \"exp-013\",\n274\t    \"description\": \"4×4 cross-model transfer matrix\",\n275\t    \"results\": {\n276\t      \"pythia_olmo_retention\": \"91-92%\",\n277\t      \"qwen_cont_cross_retention\": \"80-85%\",\n278\t      \"qwen_rw_cross_retention\": \"61-63%\",\n279\t      \"binary_0v1_cross_all_above_096\": true\n280\t    },\n281\t    \"tables\": [\n282\t      {\n283\t        \"name\": \"Table 9: Cross-model transfer retention\",\n284\t        \"content\": \"| Transfer Direction | Accuracy Retention |\\n|-------------------|-------------------|\\n| Pythia → OLMo | 92% |\\n| OLMo → Pythia | 91% |\\n| Qwen-cont → Pythia | 85% |\\n| Qwen-cont → OLMo | 80% |\\n| Qwen-rw → Pythia | 63% |\\n| Qwen-rw → OLMo | 61% |\\n\"\n285\t      }\n286\t    ],\n287\t    \"figures\": [],\n288\t    \"analysis\": \"Median 档 reviewer 评价：C1' 的 strongest supporting evidence 之一。 Transfer > 80% 在 continuation mode 下消除 scorer bias 质疑。\\n\\n\\nCross-model transfer 是 C1' \\\"text-intrinsic signal\\\" 的核心证据。 Pythia↔OLMo 91-92% retention 和 0v1 cross-AUC > 0.96 强力支持 depth signal 跨模型可迁移。 Median 档下 reviewer 正面评价： (a) \\\"The high transfer retention confirms K* is not a self-familiarity artifact\\\" (b) Qwen-rewrite 低 transfer (61-63%) 进一步区分 generation mode effect vs depth signal (c) 但 reviewer 指出 \\\"all models are ≤8B from similar training distributions,  transfer to fundamentally different models (e.g., 70B, multilingual) remains unknown\\\" 这与 A3 (scale limitation) 呼应。\\n\"\n289\t  },\n290\t  {\n291\t    \"name\": \"exp-014\",\n292\t    \"description\": \"Naturalistic validation: Common Crawl 2025/2026 snapshot depth prediction\",\n293\t    \"results\": {\n294\t      \"predicted_depth_distribution\": {\n295\t        \"depth_0\": \"60-75%\",\n296\t        \"depth_1\": \"15-25%\",\n297\t        \"depth_2_plus\": \"5-15%\"\n298\t      },\n299\t      \"correlation_with_alignscore\": \"Spearman ρ=0.15-0.30\",\n300\t      \"correlation_with_vocab_richness\": \"Spearman ρ=0.20-0.35\",\n301\t      \"predicted_contamination_rate\": \"25-40%\"\n302\t    },\n303\t    \"tables\": [],\n304\t    \"figures\": [],\n305\t    \"analysis\": \"未执行。Median 档下不影响核心评分但作为 future work 建议出现在 reviewer comments 中。\\n\\n\\nNaturalistic validation 在 median 档下是 P2 优先级，未执行。 如果执行，预期结果：Common Crawl 2025/2026 中约 25-40% 文本被预测为 depth ≥1（合成文本）， 与外部估计一致。但 ground truth 缺失使此实验无法做定量验证—— 只能做 correlation with proxy metrics。AlignScore correlation 弱（ρ~0.15-0.30） 因为 AlignScore 度量的是事实一致性而非 generational depth。 Vocab richness correlation 略强（ρ~0.20-0.35）因为递归生成确实导致 vocabulary narrowing。 Median 档 reviewer 对此实验缺失不会严重扣分（P2 priority）， 但 1 个 reviewer 可能建议 \\\"a naturalistic study would strengthen the paper's practical relevance\\\"。\\n\"\n306\t  },\n307\t  {\n308\t    \"name\": \"exp-015\",\n309\t    \"description\": \"Frozen Qwen2.5-1.5B embeddings + MLP probe vs 15D features\",\n310\t    \"results\": {\n311\t      \"pythia_k_star_neural\": 2,\n312\t      \"olmo_k_star_neural\": 2,\n313\t      \"qwen_cont_k_star_neural\": 3,\n314\t      \"qwen_cont_2v3_neural_auc\": 0.616,\n315\t      \"qwen_cont_2v3_neural_ci_lower\": 0.6099\n316\t    },\n317\t    \"tables\": [\n318\t      {\n319\t        \"name\": \"Table A5: Neural probe vs 15D features\",\n320\t        \"content\": \"| Model | K*(15D) | K*(neural) | 2v3 AUC (neural) |\\n|-------|---------|-----------|-----------------|\\n| Pythia-1.4B | 2 | 2 | 0.596 |\\n| OLMo-1B | 2 | 2 | 0.589 |\\n| Qwen-cont | 2 | 3 | 0.616 |\\n\"\n321\t      }\n322\t    ],\n323\t    \"figures\": [],\n324\t    \"analysis\": \"Median 档下 reviewer 接受 \\\"model-free features for headline K*\\\" 的选择， 但 Qwen K*_neural=3 被部分 reviewer 用来质疑 K*=2 universality。 需要 framing: \\\"K*(neural) is representation-dependent; K*(model-free) is the conservative,  universal measure we recommend for cross-model comparisons.\\\"\\n\\n\\nNeural probe 结果分裂：Pythia/OLMo K*_neural=2（与 15D 一致），Qwen-cont K*_neural=3（高于 15D）。 Qwen-cont 的差异来自 self-scorer advantage——Qwen 的 embeddings 对自己生成的文本有额外 depth signal。 Median 档下 reviewer 解读： (a) Pythia/OLMo K*_neural=2 confirms \\\"K*=2 is data-intrinsic, not feature-engineering artifact\\\" (b) Qwen K*_neural=3 被 reviewer 解读为 \\\"model-dependent K* exists in learned representations,  which contradicts the 'K* is purely text-intrinsic' narrative\\\" (c) 论文需要 careful framing：model-free 15D features 给出 universal K*， neural probe 给出 model-dependent K*——两者都是 valid 但 serve different purposes (d) 这实际上是 A8_attacked 的延伸——Qwen self-scorer 的 +1 bias 在 neural probe 中更明显\\n\"\n325\t  },\n326\t  {\n327\t    \"name\": \"exp-016\",\n328\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-1.5B base vs Instruct continuation mode comparison\",\n329\t    \"results\": {\n330\t      \"k_star\": 2,\n331\t      \"base_1v2_auc\": 0.6262,\n332\t      \"base_ci_lower\": 0.6168,\n333\t      \"instruct_1v2_auc\": 0.6112,\n334\t      \"instruct_ci_lower\": 0.6015,\n335\t      \"ci_overlap\": true\n336\t    },\n337\t    \"tables\": [\n338\t      {\n339\t        \"name\": \"Table A6: Base vs Instruct\",\n340\t        \"content\": \"| Variant | 1v2 AUC | 95% CI | K* |\\n|---------|---------|--------|-----|\\n| Base | 0.626 | [0.617, 0.635] | 2 |\\n| Instruct | 0.611 | [0.602, 0.621] | 2 |\\n\"\n341\t      }\n342\t    ],\n343\t    \"figures\": [],\n344\t    \"analysis\": \"Supporting evidence for K* robustness across base/instruct variants。不是 highlight。\\n\\n\\nBase 和 Instruct K* 一致=2，CI 重叠说明 instruction tuning 不改变 K*。 但 base 1v2 AUC (0.6262) > instruct (0.6112)，即 instruction tuning 轻微降低  depth discrimination signal（可能因为 RLHF 增加了生成多样性）。 Median 档下 reviewer 不特别关注此实验——\\\"Expected result, instruction tuning should  not fundamentally change text-intrinsic depth properties.\\\" 但 base CI lower=0.6168 vs instruct CI lower=0.6015 的差距被注意—— 如果 instruction tuning 进一步降低 signal（如更强的 RLHF），K* 可能降至 1。\\n\"\n345\t  },\n346\t  {\n347\t    \"name\": \"exp-017\",\n348\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct continuation mode, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\",\n349\t    \"results\": {\n350\t      \"k_star\": 2,\n351\t      \"pairwise_auc_1v2\": 0.6112,\n352\t      \"ci_1v2_lower\": 0.6015,\n353\t      \"pairwise_auc_2v3\": 0.5609\n354\t    },\n355\t    \"tables\": [\n356\t      {\n357\t        \"name\": \"Table 2 (row): Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct continuation\",\n358\t        \"content\": \"| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | 3v4 | 4v5 | K* |\\n|-------|------|------|------|------|------|----|\\n| Qwen-1.5B-Inst cont | 0.997 | 0.611 | 0.561 | 0.541 | 0.514 | 2 |\\n| 95% CI (1v2) | — | [0.602, 0.621] | — | — | — | — |\\n\"\n359\t      }\n360\t    ],\n361\t    \"figures\": [],\n362\t    \"analysis\": \"Median 档核心攻击目标。需要在论文中显式承认 borderline nature 并提供多层辩护。 Cross-scorer 和 θ-sensitivity 数据在正文中呈现而非藏在 appendix。\\n\\n\\nQwen-cont 1v2 AUC=0.6112，CI lower=0.6015——仅高于 θ 0.15pp。 在 median 档下这是 A8_attacked 的核心：reviewer 单独点名 \\\"CI lower=0.6015 is dangerously  close to the threshold. A few different random seeds could flip this to K*=1.\\\" 要求 sensitivity analysis：(a) 额外 seeds/bootstrap resamples，(b) θ 微调下的稳定性， (c) cross-scorer validation 下的变化。 exp-022 中 qwen_cont256×pythia K*=1 (1v2=0.5979) 进一步加剧了这个 concern—— 当 scorer 从 Qwen 换成 Pythia 时，Qwen-cont 确实可以翻转为 K*=1。 论文需要承认 Qwen-cont 处于 K*=1 和 K*=2 的边界，并以此作为 θ-sensitivity 讨论的案例。\\n\"\n363\t  },\n364\t  {\n365\t    \"name\": \"exp-018\",\n366\t    \"description\": \"LLaMA-3.1-8B, continuation mode, C4 5K docs, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\",\n367\t    \"results\": {\n368\t      \"k_star\": 2,\n369\t      \"pairwise_auc_1v2\": 0.6123,\n370\t      \"ci_1v2_lower\": 0.6028,\n371\t      \"ci_1v2_upper\": 0.6216\n372\t    },\n373\t    \"tables\": [\n374\t      {\n375\t        \"name\": \"Table 2 (row): LLaMA-3.1-8B C4 continuation\",\n376\t        \"content\": \"| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | 3v4 | 4v5 | K* |\\n|-------|------|------|------|------|------|----|\\n| LLaMA-3.1-8B | 0.923 | 0.612 | 0.527 | 0.514 | 0.510 | 2 |\\n\"\n377\t      }\n378\t    ],\n379\t    \"figures\": [],\n380\t    \"analysis\": \"LLaMA 的低 0v1 AUC (0.9225 vs others >0.96) 被 median 档 reviewer 解读为  \\\"larger models produce more human-like text\\\"——这与 A3 (scale limitation) 呼应： 更大模型可能导致 0v1 也接近 threshold。\\n\\n\\nLLaMA-8B K*=2，CI lower=0.6028 (余量 +0.28pp)。 第三个模型家族确认 C4 K*=2，增强跨架构证据。 Median 档下 reviewer 接受 LLaMA 结果但注意到： (a) CI lower=0.6028 也较边缘（虽不如 Qwen-cont 的 0.6015 极端） (b) 0v1 AUC=0.9225 是所有模型中最低的——暗示 LLaMA 的 continuation  生成与原文更相似（model quality 更高），导致整体 signal 更弱 (c) 但 K* 仍=2，支持 \\\"K* is domain-determined regardless of absolute signal strength\\\"\\n\"\n381\t  },\n382\t  {\n383\t    \"name\": \"exp-019\",\n384\t    \"description\": \"Mistral-7B-v0.3, continuation mode, C4 5K docs, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\",\n385\t    \"results\": {\n386\t      \"k_star\": 1,\n387\t      \"pairwise_auc_1v2\": 0.5935,\n388\t      \"ci_1v2_lower\": 0.5835,\n389\t      \"ci_1v2_upper\": 0.6032,\n390\t      \"p_auc_leq_060\": 0.9017\n391\t    },\n392\t    \"tables\": [\n393\t      {\n394\t        \"name\": \"Table 2 (row): Mistral-7B C4 continuation (K*=1 outlier)\",\n395\t        \"content\": \"| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | 3v4 | 4v5 | K* |\\n|-------|------|------|------|------|------|----|\\n| Mistral-7B | 0.984 | 0.594 | 0.540 | 0.523 | 0.518 | 1 |\\n| 95% CI (1v2) | — | [0.584, 0.603] | — | — | — | — |\\n\"\n396\t      }\n397\t    ],\n398\t    \"figures\": [],\n399\t    \"analysis\": \"Median 档核心攻击点之一。论文需要正面讨论 Mistral K*=1 而非 downplay， 并用 Mistral arXiv K*=3 证明 domain 仍是 primary driver。 \\\"Sole determinant\\\" → \\\"primary factor\\\" 的降级措辞是 median 档的必要调整。\\n\\n\\nMistral K*=1 是唯一的 C4 outlier（7/8 K*=2 中的例外）。 1v2 AUC=0.5935 < θ=0.60，CI upper=0.6032 仅微超 θ，说明 Mistral 一代后即 one-wash。 Median 档下的 reviewer 反应分裂： (a) Reviewer A 接受 \\\"7/8 dominant mode K*=2, with Mistral as interpretable outlier\\\" (b) Reviewer B 攻击 \\\"If 1/8 models gives K*=1, how can you claim K*=2 is universal?  This is evidence of model×domain interaction, not pure domain dependence.\\\" Cross-scorer validation (exp-019b) 确认 K*=1 是 text-intrinsic（non-scorer artifact）， 但这并不能回应 \\\"model matters\\\" 的质疑。 Mistral arXiv K*=3 (exp_arXiv_mistral7b) 是关键回应——同一模型在不同域给出不同 K*， 证明 domain 仍是 primary factor。但 reviewer 认为这只是 \\\"primary, not sole\\\"。 论文需要从 \\\"sole determinant\\\" 降级为 \\\"primary factor, with residual model effects\\\"。\\n\"\n400\t  },\n401\t  {\n402\t    \"name\": \"exp-020\",\n403\t    \"description\": \"Pythia-1.4B decoding ablation: 4 strategies, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\",\n404\t    \"results\": {\n405\t      \"all_k_star_2\": true,\n406\t      \"greedy_1v2\": 0.8838,\n407\t      \"nuc09_1v2\": 0.677,\n408\t      \"t07_1v2\": 0.7265,\n409\t      \"t12_1v2\": 0.6172\n410\t    },\n411\t    \"tables\": [\n412\t      {\n413\t        \"name\": \"Table A7: Pythia decoding ablation\",\n414\t        \"content\": \"| Decoding | 1v2 AUC | 2v3 AUC | K* |\\n|----------|---------|---------|-----|\\n| greedy | 0.884 | 0.534 | 2 |\\n| nucleus p=0.9 | 0.677 | 0.555 | 2 |\\n| T=0.7 | 0.727 | 0.594 | 2 |\\n| T=1.2 | 0.617 | 0.523 | 2 |\\n\"\n415\t      }\n416\t    ],\n417\t    \"figures\": [],\n418\t    \"analysis\": \"Supporting evidence，放 Appendix。Greedy 的 repetition collapse 作为 caveat 在正文中提及。\\n\\n\\nPythia 上 4 种解码策略 K* 全部=2，跨模型复制 exp-003 的解码不变性。 Greedy 1v2=0.8838 极高——因为 greedy decoding 引入 repetition collapse， 使 depth 1 和 depth 2 文本差异大。T=1.2 的 1v2=0.6172 最低（高温增加随机性，模糊差异）。 Median 档下 reviewer 正面评价跨模型 decoding invariance： \\\"K*=2 holds across 2 models × 4 decoding strategies = 8 conditions, which is convincing.\\\" 但 greedy 的异常高 AUC 被注意——\\\"greedy is a degenerate condition that amplifies artifacts,  it shouldn't be treated as equally valid.\\\"\\n\"\n419\t  },\n420\t  {\n421\t    \"name\": \"exp-021\",\n422\t    \"description\": \"Text length ablation: 128/256/512 tokens, Qwen continuation\",\n423\t    \"results\": {\n424\t      \"128tok_k_star\": 2,\n425\t      \"256tok_k_star\": 2,\n426\t      \"512tok_k_star\": 2,\n427\t      \"512tok_1v2_ci_lower\": 0.5979,\n428\t      \"512tok_verdict\": \"BORDERLINE\"\n429\t    },\n430\t    \"tables\": [\n431\t      {\n432\t        \"name\": \"Table A8: Length ablation\",\n433\t        \"content\": \"| Length | 1v2 AUC | CI lower | K* |\\n|--------|---------|---------|-----|\\n| 128 tok | 0.622 | >0.60 | 2 |\\n| 256 tok | 0.628 | >0.60 | 2 |\\n| 512 tok | 0.607 | 0.598 | 2* |\\n\"\n434\t      }\n435\t    ],\n436\t    \"figures\": [],\n437\t    \"analysis\": \"512-token borderline 被 median 档 reviewer 视为 minor concern。 与 Qwen-cont CI lower=0.6015 的边缘性一起被归入 \\\"robustness limitations\\\" 段。\\n\\n\\nK*=2 在三种长度下一致。但 512tok 的 CI lower=0.5979 < θ 是 borderline failure—— 在 median 档下 reviewer 注意到 \\\"longer texts paradoxically reduce discriminability,  which is counter-intuitive and requires explanation.\\\" 解释：512 tokens 的 continuation 更有空间 converge to the generator's style， 使 depth 1 和 depth 2 更相似。这与 \\\"one-wash laundering\\\" 概念一致。 但 reviewer 认为 \\\"if the result flips at 512 tokens, the 256-token headline results  may be cherry-picking the optimal length.\\\" 论文需要承认 length sensitivity 并在主文讨论。\\n\"\n438\t  },\n439\t  {\n440\t    \"name\": \"exp-022\",\n441\t    \"description\": \"4×4 cross-scorer matrix: 4 generators × 4 scorers\",\n442\t    \"results\": {\n443\t      \"k_star_2_count\": 11,\n444\t      \"k_star_1_count\": 1,\n445\t      \"exception\": \"qwen_cont256×pythia (1v2=0.5979)\",\n446\t      \"scorer_delta_within_generator\": \"<0.025\"\n447\t    },\n448\t    \"tables\": [\n449\t      {\n450\t        \"name\": \"Table 10: Cross-scorer matrix (selected)\",\n451\t        \"content\": \"| Generator × Scorer | 1v2 AUC | K* |\\n|-------------------|---------|-----|\\n| Qwen-base × OLMo | 0.605 | 2 |\\n| Qwen-base × Pythia | 0.617 | 2 |\\n| Qwen-cont × Pythia | 0.598 | 1 |\\n| Qwen-cont × Qwen-base | 0.628 | 2 |\\n\"\n452\t      }\n453\t    ],\n454\t    \"figures\": [],\n455\t    \"analysis\": \"Scorer independence confirmed。论文在正文中展示完整矩阵以预防 \\\"self-scorer bias\\\" 攻击。\\n\\n\\n11/12 combos K*=2 是 scorer independence 的强证据。 唯一例外 qwen_cont256×pythia (K*=1) 被 reviewer 注意但不被严重攻击—— 因为 Qwen-cont 本身就是最 marginal 的 generator（CI lower=0.6015）， 换 scorer 后 flip 到 K*=1 是 consistent with its borderline nature。 Median 档下 reviewer 正面评价：\\\"Scorer independence is well-established.  The paper correctly identifies and discusses the single exception.\\\" 但 A8_attacked 的 reviewer 用这个数据加强攻击：\\\"Even with different scorers,  Qwen-cont is unstable.\\\"\\n\"\n456\t  },\n457\t  {\n458\t    \"name\": \"exp-023\",\n459\t    \"description\": \"Wikipedia domain, Qwen2.5-1.5B base continuation, 5K docs, depth 0-5\",\n460\t    \"results\": {\n461\t      \"k_star\": 2,\n462\t      \"one_v_two_auc\": 0.6193,\n463\t      \"all_folds_above_060\": true\n464\t    },\n465\t    \"tables\": [\n466\t      {\n467\t        \"name\": \"Table 11 (row): Wikipedia domain K*\",\n468\t        \"content\": \"| Domain | Scorer | 1v2 AUC | K* |\\n|--------|--------|---------|-----|\\n| Wikipedia | Qwen (same-family) | 0.619 | 2 |\\n| Wikipedia | Pythia (cross-family) | 0.585 | 1 |\\n| Wikipedia | scorer-controlled | — | 1 |\\n\"\n469\t      }\n470\t    ],\n471\t    \"figures\": [],\n472\t    \"analysis\": \"Scorer confound on Wikipedia 是 honest reporting，增加论文可信度。 但 K*=1 for Wikipedia 被 reviewer 解读为 \\\"trivial — one generation washes everything.\\\"\\n\\n\\nWikipedia K*=2 (same-family scorer) 但经 D060 cross-scorer confound 分析后降为 K*=1。 这是 median 档中 scorer confound 的 key demonstration： Qwen same-family scorer 在 Wikipedia 上给出 +1 bias（K*=2）， 换 Pythia cross-family scorer 后 K*=1。 论文正文报告 scorer-controlled K*=1 for Wikipedia, Appendix 披露 confound 细节。 Reviewer 接受 confound 控制但质疑：\\\"If the simplest domain already saturates at K*=1,  and web text at K*=2, the range {1,2,3} is very narrow.  Is the finding essentially that recursive generation quickly loses information?\\\" 这触发 A1 (\\\"somewhat expected\\\")。\\n\"\n473\t  },\n474\t  {\n475\t    \"name\": \"exp-024\",\n476\t    \"description\": \"arXiv domain, Qwen2.5-1.5B base continuation, 5K docs, depth 0-5\",\n477\t    \"results\": {\n478\t      \"k_star\": 3,\n479\t      \"pairwise_auc_1v2\": 0.858,\n480\t      \"pairwise_auc_2v3\": 0.6427,\n481\t      \"ci_2v3_lower\": 0.6275\n482\t    },\n483\t    \"tables\": [\n484\t      {\n485\t        \"name\": \"Table 11 (row): arXiv domain K*\",\n486\t        \"content\": \"| Domain | 1v2 AUC | 2v3 AUC | 3v4 AUC | K* |\\n|--------|---------|---------|---------|-----|\\n| arXiv | 0.858 | 0.643 | 0.544 | 3 |\\n\"\n487\t      }\n488\t    ],\n489\t    \"figures\": [],\n490\t    \"analysis\": \"K*=3 on arXiv 是论文的 strongest individual finding，但 3-domain limitation 被 reviewer 攻击。 exp_027 LaTeX ablation (K*=3 preserved after stripping) 有效消除格式 confound。\\n\\n\\narXiv K*=3 是 domain dependence 的最强证据——首个 K*>2 的条件。 2v3 AUC=0.6427, CI lower=0.6275 >> θ=0.60（余量 +2.75pp）。 1v2 AUC=0.858 远超 C4/Wiki (~0.61-0.69)，arXiv 的 LaTeX/citation/math  结构特征提供额外 depth-distinguishing signal。 Median 档下 reviewer 反应： (a) 正面：K*=3 on arXiv is a genuinely interesting finding, domain dependence is well-demonstrated (b) 攻击：A2 假设触发——\\\"3 domains is too few to claim 'domain is the sole determinant'.  What about code, legal text, news, social media?\\\" (c) 建议：需要更多域来充分支持 domain hierarchy claim 论文需要降级措辞从 \\\"sole determinant\\\" 到 \\\"primary factor\\\"， 承认 3 domains 是 initial evidence 而非 exhaustive characterization。\\n\"\n491\t  },\n492\t  {\n493\t    \"name\": \"exp-025\",\n494\t    \"description\": \"Pythia-1.4B filtering replication: 3 strategies × 3 seeds\",\n495\t    \"results\": {\n496\t      \"all_strategies_nearly_identical\": true,\n497\t      \"max_delta_mmlu\": 0.0017,\n498\t      \"binary_hellaswag_delta\": \"+0.0000\",\n499\t      \"key_finding\": \"null result\"\n500\t    },\n501\t    \"tables\": [\n502\t      {\n503\t        \"name\": \"Table A9: Pythia filtering (null result)\",\n504\t        \"content\": \"| Strategy | MMLU | HellaSwag |\\n|----------|------|-----------|\\n| binary-ours | 0.259±0.000 | 0.525±0.000 |\\n| graduated α=0.9 | 0.256±0.001 | 0.525±0.001 |\\n| no-filter | 0.257±0.001 | 0.525±0.001 |\\n\"\n505\t      }\n506\t    ],\n507\t    \"figures\": [],\n508\t    \"analysis\": \"Null result。放 Appendix 作为 honest reporting。 C3 的证据链因此完全依赖 exp-006 (Qwen) 和 exp-009 (dose-response)。 Median 档 reviewer 评价 C3 substance ~2.5。\\n\\n\\nPythia-1.4B 上三种策略产生几乎相同结果（max Δ=0.0017 MMLU），filtering ordering 未确认。 Median 档下这是 C3 的严重打击（A5_fail 部分）： (a) Pythia 太小（1.4B, MMLU~0.26）对 filtering signal 不敏感——模型 capacity 不足 (b) 但 reviewer 质疑 \\\"if filtering doesn't help even small models, why should we trust  it helps larger ones?\\\" (c) 论文需要 framing：Pythia 的 base capability 太低（MMLU=0.26 接近 random）， filtering 的 marginal benefit 在 low-capability regime 被淹没 (d) 这个 null result 被 1 个 reviewer 肯定（\\\"honest reporting of negative results\\\"）， 被另一个 reviewer 用来质疑 C3 整体证据链\\n\"\n509\t  },\n510\t  {\n511\t    \"name\": \"exp-026\",\n512\t    \"description\": \"arXiv graduated vs binary filtering: Qwen base + LoRA, K*=3 domain, 3 strategies × 5 seeds\",\n513\t    \"results\": {\n514\t      \"graduated_equals_no_filter\": true,\n515\t      \"binary_mmlu_delta\": \"-0.0023\",\n516\t      \"binary_hellaswag_delta\": \"+0.0042\",\n517\t      \"graduated_mmlu_delta\": \"+0.0001\",\n518\t      \"graduated_hellaswag_delta\": \"-0.0001\",\n519\t      \"key_finding\": \"null result — graduated ≈ no_filter on K*=3 domain\"\n520\t    },\n521\t    \"tables\": [\n522\t      {\n523\t        \"name\": \"Table 12: arXiv filtering results (negative)\",\n524\t        \"content\": \"| Strategy | MMLU | HellaSwag | Δ MMLU | Δ HellaSwag |\\n|----------|------|-----------|--------|-------------|\\n| no-filter | 0.590±0.001 | 0.660±0.000 | — | — |\\n| binary | 0.588±0.000 | 0.664±0.000 | -0.002 | +0.004* |\\n| graduated α=0.9 | 0.590±0.001 | 0.660±0.000 | +0.000 | -0.000 |\\n\"\n525\t      }\n526\t    ],\n527\t    \"figures\": [],\n528\t    \"analysis\": \"Negative result honestly reported。Section 5 adds this as \\\"boundary conditions of K*-aware curation.\\\" Discussion adds key insight: \\\"K* ≠ data utility.\\\"  Median 档 negative_result_credibility_boost = 0.0-0.5（modest boost from honesty,  offset by weakened C3）。\\n\\n\\n这是 C3 的 fatal blow：即使在 K*=3 域（理论上 graduated 应该有优势）， graduated ≈ no_filter，binary 有 metric-specific trade-off（MMLU -0.23pp, HellaSwag +0.42pp）。 Median 档下 A5_fail 完全触发： (a) \\\"If graduated filtering fails even on K*=3 where it should work best,  the entire K*-aware curation thesis is undermined\\\" (b) 论文需要将 C3 降级为 \\\"case study\\\" 而非 \\\"validation\\\" (c) 关键 insight（放 Discussion）：K* characterizes signal discriminability,  not data utility — depth 2-3 text is statistically distinguishable but removing it  doesn't improve training (d) Binary filtering 的 HellaSwag 优势可能来自 removing any synthetic data  (regardless of depth)，而非 depth-aware curation (e) 1 个 reviewer 肯定这个 negative result 的 honesty， 但另一个 reviewer 认为 C3 整体不成立\\n\"\n529\t  },\n530\t  {\n531\t    \"name\": \"exp-027\",\n532\t    \"description\": \"LaTeX markup removal ablation on arXiv data\",\n533\t    \"results\": {\n534\t      \"k_star_preserved\": true,\n535\t      \"original_2v3\": 0.6436,\n536\t      \"stripped_2v3\": 0.6229,\n537\t      \"delta_2v3\": -0.021\n538\t    },\n539\t    \"tables\": [\n540\t      {\n541\t        \"name\": \"Table A10: LaTeX ablation\",\n542\t        \"content\": \"| Condition | 1v2 AUC | 2v3 AUC | K* |\\n|-----------|---------|---------|-----|\\n| Original | 0.858 | 0.644 | 3 |\\n| LaTeX stripped | 0.830 | 0.623 | 3 |\\n| Δ | -0.028 | -0.021 | — |\\n\"\n543\t      }\n544\t    ],\n545\t    \"figures\": [],\n546\t    \"analysis\": \"Effective confound control。Median 档 reviewer 不攻击此实验。\\n\\n\\nK*=3 在去除 LaTeX 标记后保持，2v3 AUC 从 0.6436 降至 0.6229 但仍 > θ=0.60。 LaTeX 格式贡献约 2pp AUC 但不是 K*=3 的 confound。 Median 档下 reviewer 正面评价：\\\"Good ablation that rules out the obvious confound.  K*=3 on arXiv is driven by content structural complexity, not just formatting.\\\" 但 reviewer 注意到 stripped 2v3=0.6229 余量仅 +2.29pp，如果进一步去除  other structural markers (citation patterns, section numbering), K* 可能降至 2。\\n\"\n547\t  },\n548\t  {\n549\t    \"name\": \"exp-028\",\n550\t    \"description\": \"Subsampling power curve: C4 n={1000,2000,3000,4000,5000} × 10 resamples\",\n551\t    \"results\": {\n552\t      \"n_1000_k_star_2_rate\": \"6-7/10 (unstable)\",\n553\t      \"n_2000_k_star_2_rate\": \"8-9/10 (mostly stable)\",\n554\t      \"n_3000_k_star_2_rate\": \"9-10/10 (stable)\",\n555\t      \"n_5000_k_star_2_rate\": \"10/10 (robust)\",\n556\t      \"minimum_n_for_robust_k_star\": \"~2500-3000\",\n557\t      \"ci_width_at_n_1000\": \"±0.025-0.030\",\n558\t      \"ci_width_at_n_5000\": \"±0.010-0.012\"\n559\t    },\n560\t    \"tables\": [\n561\t      {\n562\t        \"name\": \"Table A11: Subsampling power curve\",\n563\t        \"content\": \"| n | K*=2 rate | 1v2 CI width | Median 1v2 AUC |\\n|------|-----------|-------------|---------------|\\n| 1000 | 65% | ±0.028 | 0.652 |\\n| 2000 | 85% | ±0.019 | 0.653 |\\n| 3000 | 95% | ±0.015 | 0.654 |\\n| 4000 | 98% | ±0.012 | 0.654 |\\n| 5000 | 100% | ±0.010 | 0.654 |\\n\"\n564\t      }\n565\t    ],\n566\t    \"figures\": [],\n567\t    \"analysis\": \"未执行（planned）。如果在 rebuttal 中补充，可回应 \\\"statistical power\\\" 质疑。 Median 档 reviewer 不会因缺失此实验降分但可能作为 minor revision 要求。\\n\\n\\nPower analysis 在 median 档下是 reviewer 可能要求但非 P0 的实验。如果执行： n=1000 时 CI 太宽（±2.5-3.0pp），K*=2 判定在约 60-70% resamples 中成立——不 robust。 n=3000 时稳定，n=5000 完全 robust。 这回应了 reviewer 对 sample size 的潜在质疑，并提供 practical guidance： \\\"K*=2 判定需要 ≥2500 samples per depth pair for 90% power.\\\" Median 档下如果缺少此实验，reviewer 可能在 Minor Revisions 中要求补充。 如果存在，被评为 \\\"useful methodological contribution for practitioners.\\\"\\n\"\n568\t  },\n569\t  {\n570\t    \"name\": \"exp_arXiv_cross_validation (5-model)\",\n571\t    \"description\": \"arXiv K*=3 cross-validation: 5 models × 4 architecture families\",\n572\t    \"results\": {\n573\t      \"qwen_1b5_k_star\": 3,\n574\t      \"pythia_k_star\": 3,\n575\t      \"llama_8b_k_star\": 3,\n576\t      \"mistral_7b_k_star\": 3,\n577\t      \"qwen_7b_k_star\": 3,\n578\t      \"olmo_k_star\": 1,\n579\t      \"domain_competent_models_k3_rate\": \"5/5 (100%)\",\n580\t      \"olmo_capacity_failure\": true\n581\t    },\n582\t    \"tables\": [\n583\t      {\n584\t        \"name\": \"Table 13: arXiv K*=3 cross-validation\",\n585\t        \"content\": \"| Model | Family | 2v3 AUC | K* |\\n|-------|--------|---------|-----|\\n| Qwen-1.5B | Qwen | 0.643 | 3 |\\n| Pythia-1.4B | GPT-NeoX | 0.654 | 3 |\\n| LLaMA-8B | LLaMA | 0.622 | 3 |\\n| Mistral-7B | Mistral | 0.628 | 3 |\\n| Qwen-7B | Qwen | 0.626 | 3 |\\n| OLMo-1B | OLMo | 0.503 | 1 (capacity fail) |\\n\"\n586\t      }\n587\t    ],\n588\t    \"figures\": [],\n589\t    \"analysis\": \"Domain dependence 的 crown jewel evidence。Mistral C4 K*=1 → arXiv K*=3 的跃变 是论文最有说服力的 single finding。Median 档 reviewer 评分： soundness 3.0-3.5 for C1' domain dependence sub-claim。\\n\\n\\n五个 domain-competent 模型在 arXiv 上 100% 一致 K*=3（跨 4 架构族）。 OLMo-1B K*=1 因 capacity failure（生成出域文本）。 Median 档下 reviewer 高度正面评价 domain dependence evidence： \\\"5/5 domain-competent models all yielding K*=3 on arXiv is strong cross-validation.\\\" 但 A2 仍被触发——\\\"Even with 5-model cross-validation, 3 domains is still 3 domains.  The domain hierarchy Wikipedia(1)<C4(2)<arXiv(3) could just be ordered by text complexity.\\\" Reviewer 建议增加 code/legal/social media domains。 OLMo capacity failure 被正面引用：\\\"Correctly identified as prerequisite analysis,  not counted against the domain claim.\\\"\\n\"\n590\t  },\n591\t  {\n592\t    \"name\": \"exp_wiki_scorer_confound\",\n593\t    \"description\": \"Wikipedia scorer confound: Qwen same-family vs Pythia cross-family scorer\",\n594\t    \"results\": {\n595\t      \"qwen_scorer_k_star\": 2,\n596\t      \"pythia_crossscorer_k_star\": 1,\n597\t      \"critical_delta_1v2\": -0.024,\n598\t      \"confound_verdict\": \"confirmed\"\n599\t    },\n600\t    \"tables\": [\n601\t      {\n602\t        \"name\": \"Table A12: Wikipedia scorer confound\",\n603\t        \"content\": \"| Scorer | 1v2 AUC | K* |\\n|--------|---------|-----|\\n| Qwen (same-family) | 0.619 | 2 |\\n| Pythia (cross-family) | 0.587 | 1 |\\n\"\n604\t      }\n605\t    ],\n606\t    \"figures\": [],\n607\t    \"analysis\": \"Honest reporting 增加论文可信度。Median 档 reviewer 正面评价但用此质疑 C4 结果。\\n\\n\\nWikipedia 上 Qwen same-family scorer 给出 K*=2，换 Pythia cross-family scorer 后降为 K*=1。 Δ1v2=-0.024 证明 +1 bias 存在。Median 档下： (a) Reviewer 肯定 confound detection and control：\\\"Good scientific practice to identify  and report scorer bias.\\\" (b) 论文正文报告 K*=1 (scorer-controlled)，增加可信度 (c) 但 reviewer 追问：\\\"If same-family scorer bias exists on Wikipedia,  could it also affect C4 results (e.g., Qwen-cont CI lower=0.6015)?\\\" (d) Exp-022 的 cross-scorer matrix 部分回应这个问题（C4 上 11/12 K*=2）， 但 Qwen-cont×Pythia K*=1 加剧 concern\\n\"\n608\t  },\n609\t  {\n610\t    \"name\": \"exp_14b_c4\",\n611\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-14B, continuation mode, C4, depth 0-5 — scale extension for rebuttal\",\n612\t    \"results\": {\n613\t      \"k_star\": 2,\n614\t      \"pairwise_auc_1v2\": 0.621,\n615\t      \"ci_1v2_lower\": 0.6119,\n616\t      \"ci_1v2_upper\": 0.6304\n617\t    },\n618\t    \"tables\": [\n619\t      {\n620\t        \"name\": \"Rebuttal Table R1: Scale extension\",\n621\t        \"content\": \"| Scale | 1v2 AUC | CI lower | K* |\\n|-------|---------|---------|-----|\\n| 1.4B (Pythia) | 0.654 | 0.645 | 2 |\\n| 1.5B (Qwen) | 0.611 | 0.602 | 2 |\\n| 7B (Qwen) | 0.618 | 0.608 | 2 |\\n| 8B (LLaMA) | 0.612 | 0.603 | 2 |\\n| 14B (Qwen) | 0.621 | 0.612 | 2 |\\n\"\n622\t      }\n623\t    ],\n624\t    \"figures\": [],\n625\t    \"analysis\": \"Rebuttal 核心证据。1.4B→14B 10× scale range 下 K*=2 一致。 如果 32B 也确认，可有效回应 A3，将 reviewer 从 \\\"significant weakness\\\" 降为 \\\"minor limitation\\\"。\\n\\n\\n14B scale 下 K*=2 维持，CI lower=0.6119 > θ（余量 +1.19pp）。 这是回应 A3 (scale limitation) 的关键 rebuttal evidence： \\\"K*=2 is confirmed from 1.4B to 14B (10× scale range), with consistent CI lower > θ.\\\" Median 档下如果在 rebuttal 中呈现： (a) 1 个 reviewer 接受 \\\"14B extends the scale range meaningfully\\\" (b) 但要求 32B 数据来确认 trend (c) exp_32b_c4 正在运行——如果也是 K*=2，rebuttal 极大增强\\n\"\n626\t  },\n627\t  {\n628\t    \"name\": \"exp_026_arxiv_filtering_integrated\",\n629\t    \"description\": \"arXiv graduated filtering negative result integrated into paper narrative\",\n630\t    \"results\": {\n631\t      \"section_5_addition\": \"arXiv null result table with paired t-tests\",\n632\t      \"discussion_insight\": \"K* ≠ data utility\",\n633\t      \"negative_result_credibility_boost\": \"0.0-0.5\",\n634\t      \"c3_downgrade\": \"validation → case study\"\n635\t    },\n636\t    \"tables\": [],\n637\t    \"figures\": [],\n638\t    \"analysis\": \"整合 negative results 是 median 档下的最优策略。 完全不报告 → reviewer 如果知道了会更严厉；过度辩护 → 不可信。 \\\"Case study\\\" framing 是平衡点：承认 limitation 但保留 positive evidence (exp-006, exp-009)。\\n\\n将 exp-026 negative result 正式整合入论文：Section 5 增加 arXiv null result， Discussion 增加 \\\"K* characterizes discriminability, not utility\\\" 洞察。 Median 档下的效果： (a) 1 个 reviewer 明确肯定 honest reporting：\\\"The authors' willingness to report  negative results and adjust claims accordingly is commendable.\\\" (b) 但 credibility boost 被 C3 整体弱化所抵消——honestly reporting failure  doesn't make the contribution stronger, it just makes the paper more trustworthy (c) \\\"K* ≠ data utility\\\" insight 被 1 个 reviewer 视为 \\\"interesting secondary finding\\\" 但另一个 reviewer 认为 \\\"this undermines the practical motivation of the paper\\\" (d) C3 contribution 从 \\\"validation that K* informs optimal filtering granularity\\\"  降级为 \\\"case study demonstrating that K*-aware binary filtering provides modest  improvement on web text, with boundary conditions on other domains\\\"\\n\"\n639\t  }\n640\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2db4af87-0b62-4e08-8d83-6a4871881bec","uuid":"d1952b85-ebe0-4b5b-8515-08bea3598594","timestamp":"2026-05-18T13:20:59.211Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_7/projects/gen-depth-contamination/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T125757/median/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"mvp-001\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct rewrite mode pilot, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k_star\": 2,\n      \"pairwise_auc_0v1\": 0.9956,\n      \"pairwise_auc_1v2\": 0.6957,\n      \"pairwise_auc_2v3\": 0.5893,\n      \"pairwise_auc_3v4\": 0.5434,\n      \"pairwise_auc_4v5\": 0.5343,\n      \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.4182,\n      \"ordinal_mae\": 1.0163\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 1 (partial): Pairwise AUC — MVP pilot\",\n        \"content\": \"| Pair | AUC    | 95% CI           | > θ=0.60? |\\n|------|--------|------------------|-----------|\\n| 0v1  | 0.9956 | [0.9946, 0.9965] | ✅ (+39.5pp) |\\n| 1v2  | 0.6957 | [0.6859, 0.7041] | ✅ (+8.6pp)  |\\n| 2v3  | 0.5893 | [0.5795, 0.5991] | ❌           |\\n| 3v4  | 0.5434 | [0.5333, 0.5551] | ❌           |\\n| 4v5  | 0.5343 | [0.5238, 0.5448] | ❌           |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Reviewer A 接受 rewrite mode 作为 pilot 合理。Reviewer B 质疑为何论文早期版本以 rewrite AUC  (0.6957) 为 headline 而非 continuation (0.6114)——存在 cherry-picking 嫌疑。 Median 档下需在论文中明确标注 mvp-001 为 pilot，所有 figure 和 headline number 基于 continuation mode。\\n\\n\\nRewrite mode 因 instruction-following 引入 mode-specific style artifacts，放大 depth signal 至 1v2 AUC=0.6957。 在 median 档下，1-2 个 reviewer 注意到 rewrite mode 的高 AUC 不能代表 canonical condition， 要求论文明确将此实验定位为 \\\"pilot study demonstrating feasibility\\\"。2v3=0.5893 < θ=0.60  确认 K*=2，但 reviewer 指出 rewrite mode 的 signal amplification 使 K*=2 判定比 continuation  更容易，质疑是否该用 rewrite 的高 AUC 作为 headline number。 Median 档 reviewer 接受此实验作为 motivation，但要求所有 cross-model claims 基于 continuation mode。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-001\",\n    \"description\": \"Pythia-1.4B, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k_star\": 2,\n      \"pairwise_auc_0v1\": 0.9932,\n      \"pairwise_auc_1v2\": 0.6539,\n      \"pairwise_auc_2v3\": 0.5515,\n      \"pairwise_auc_3v4\": 0.5153,\n      \"pairwise_auc_4v5\": 0.5135,\n      \"ci_1v2_lower\": 0.6454,\n      \"ci_1v2_upper\": 0.663,\n      \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.383,\n      \"ordinal_mae\": 1.14\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 2 (row): Pythia-1.4B C4 continuation\",\n        \"content\": \"| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | 3v4 | 4v5 | K* |\\n|-------|------|------|------|------|------|----|\\n| Pythia-1.4B | 0.993 | 0.654 | 0.552 | 0.515 | 0.514 | 2 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"稳健但不 exciting。Median 档 reviewer 视为 \\\"solid but incremental evidence for a somewhat  expected finding\\\"。Pythia 的较高 1v2 AUC (vs Qwen-cont 0.6112) 减少了 borderline concern， 但也没有超出 reviewer 的信息论直觉预期。\\n\\n\\nPythia-1.4B 作为第一个 continuation mode 跨模型验证，1v2 AUC=0.6539 距 θ=0.60 有 +4.5pp 余量， 是 C4 web text 上 K*=2 的稳健证据。2v3 AUC=0.5515 远低于 θ，sharp boundary 明确。 在 median 档下，reviewer 接受 Pythia 的 K*=2 判定没有争议（CI lower=0.6454 >> 0.60）， 但指出 Pythia-1.4B 作为较老架构，代表性受限——单独一个模型不足以 claim universality。 Reviewer 认为此结果 \\\"expected given information-theoretic intuition\\\"（A1 假设）， 递归生成必然快速退化是直觉上合理的，K*=2 不算 surprising。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-002\",\n    \"description\": \"OLMo-1B, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k_star\": 2,\n      \"pairwise_auc_0v1\": 0.997,\n      \"pairwise_auc_1v2\": 0.6146,\n      \"pairwise_auc_2v3\": 0.5497,\n      \"pairwise_auc_3v4\": 0.509,\n      \"pairwise_auc_4v5\": 0.5044,\n      \"ci_1v2_lower\": 0.6045,\n      \"ci_1v2_upper\": 0.6247,\n      \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.3685,\n      \"ordinal_mae\": 1.1813\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 2 (row): OLMo-1B C4 continuation\",\n        \"content\": \"| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | 3v4 | 4v5 | K* |\\n|-------|------|------|------|------|------|----|\\n| OLMo-1B | 0.997 | 0.615 | 0.550 | 0.509 | 0.504 | 2 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"与 Pythia 一致，增强跨模型证据。OLMo 3v4/4v5 接近 0.50 (chance)， 进一步确认 depth ≥3 后信号完全消失。Reviewer 不质疑此具体结果。\\n\\n\\nOLMo-1B 1v2 AUC=0.6146，CI lower=0.6045，余量 +0.45pp。比 Pythia 更边缘但仍 pass。 Median 档下 reviewer 注意到 OLMo 的 CI lower 只比 θ 高 0.45pp，但未被单独点名 （Qwen-cont 的 0.6015 更 marginal 所以吸引了注意力）。 OLMo 1v2=0.6146 和 Pythia 1v2=0.6539 的差异暗示 model 确实对 signal strength 有影响， 但两者 K* 一致=2，支持 \\\"domain is primary determinant\\\" 的 claim。 Reviewer 接受 Pythia↔OLMo 的一致性但指出只有两个 continuation mode 模型在此阶段不够。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-003\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-1.5B decoding strategy ablation: greedy / nucleus p=0.9 / T=0.7 / T=1.2\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k_star\": 2,\n      \"k_star_robust\": true,\n      \"greedy_1v2_auc\": 0.6892,\n      \"nuc09_1v2_auc\": 0.6862,\n      \"t07_1v2_auc\": 0.6885,\n      \"t12_1v2_auc\": 0.7037,\n      \"auc_1v2_range\": \"[0.6862, 0.7037]\",\n      \"all_k_star_2\": true,\n      \"nuc09_2v3_ci_upper\": 0.601\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 3: Decoding strategy ablation\",\n        \"content\": \"| Decoding | 0v1 AUC | 1v2 AUC | 2v3 AUC | K* |\\n|----------|---------|---------|---------|-----|\\n| greedy   | 0.9796  | 0.6892  | 0.5612  | 2   |\\n| nucleus p=0.9 | 0.9945 | 0.6862 | 0.5917 | 2 |\\n| T=0.7    | 0.9877  | 0.6885  | 0.5901  | 2   |\\n| T=1.2    | 0.9982  | 0.7037  | 0.5820  | 2   |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Decoding invariance 是 C1' 的重要支柱。Median 档 reviewer 接受此结论但权重较低 （\\\"somewhat expected — decoding shouldn't change fundamental information loss\\\"）。 exp-020 在 Pythia continuation 上的 replication 增强了此证据。\\n\\n\\n四种解码策略下 K* 完全一致=2，AUC range < 2pp。这是 median 档下 reviewer 较认可的证据—— 解码策略不变性消除了 \\\"K*=2 是特定 sampling 参数的 artifact\\\" 的质疑。 但 nuc09 2v3 CI upper=0.601 接触 θ=0.60 边界，被注意但未被重点攻击（因为是 CI upper 而非 lower）。 Reviewer 注意到此实验仅在 Qwen rewrite mode 上做（后 exp-020 在 Pythia 上复制）， rewrite mode 的 higher baseline signal 使 K*=2 更容易 robust， 需要 continuation mode 上同样的 ablation 来增强说服力。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-004\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-7B, continuation mode, C4 5K docs, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k_star\": 2,\n      \"pairwise_auc_1v2\": 0.6178,\n      \"ci_1v2_lower\": 0.6079,\n      \"ci_1v2_upper\": 0.6261,\n      \"pairwise_auc_2v3\": 0.546,\n      \"ci_2v3_upper\": 0.5594,\n      \"pairwise_auc_4v5_perm_p\": 0.0676\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 2 (row): Qwen2.5-7B C4 continuation\",\n        \"content\": \"| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | 3v4 | 4v5 | K* |\\n|-------|------|------|------|------|------|----|\\n| Qwen2.5-7B | 0.964 | 0.618 | 0.546 | 0.523 | 0.509 | 2 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Scale invariance (1.5B→7B) 被 1 个 reviewer 认为是 \\\"weak evidence for scale generalization\\\"。 Rebuttal 需要 14B/32B 数据。exp_14b_c4 (K*=2) 已可用但 exp_32b_c4 仍在跑。 如果 32B 也给 K*=2，可在 rebuttal 中有效回应 A3。\\n\\n\\n7B scale 下 K*=2 与 1.5B 一致，CI lower=0.6079 > θ（余量 +0.79pp）。 在 median 档下，reviewer 接受 1.5B→7B 的 scale invariance 但力度不足： (a) 只从 1.5B 到 7B 不算大幅 scale-up；(b) A3 假设被触发——至少一个 reviewer  标记 \\\"≤8B is a significant limitation, need 13B+ evidence\\\"。 4v5 pair p=0.0676 non-significant，被 reviewer 视为 \\\"depth ≥4 信号消失的进一步证据\\\"， 有利于 K*=2 的 claim。但 reviewer 质疑：如果更大模型（70B）生成更高质量文本， K* 可能增加——作者需要 theoretically argue 或 empirically show 这一点。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-005\",\n    \"description\": \"Feature group ablation + degradation ordering analysis\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"cross_model_spearman_rho_pythia_olmo\": 0.95,\n      \"cross_model_spearman_rho_pythia_qwen_cont\": 0.9143,\n      \"cross_model_spearman_rho_olmo_qwen_cont\": 0.85,\n      \"shared_top_discriminators\": \"surp_d1_std, surp_std, surp_d2_std\",\n      \"1v2_tau_weakness\": \"~0.37\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table A2: Cross-model feature ranking Spearman ρ\",\n        \"content\": \"| Model Pair | Spearman ρ |\\n|------------|-----------|\\n| Pythia ↔ OLMo | 0.950 |\\n| Pythia ↔ Qwen-cont | 0.914 |\\n| OLMo ↔ Qwen-cont | 0.850 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Supporting evidence for text-intrinsic signal。不构成独立卖点但消除 \\\"model self-familiarity\\\" 质疑。 Median 档下这个实验的贡献被 reviewer 归入 \\\"thorough analysis\\\" 而非 novel finding。\\n\\n\\nFeature ordering 跨模型高度一致（ρ≥0.85），支持 depth signal 是 text-intrinsic 而非 model-specific。 Median 档下 reviewer 接受 feature ranking consistency 但不视为独立贡献—— \\\"Feature analysis is supportive but expected if the underlying signal is text-intrinsic.\\\" 1v2 pair 的 feature importance 一致性最弱（τ~0.37），被 reviewer 注意但不重点攻击 （因为这恰好是 boundary pair，信号最微弱处 variance 大是合理的）。 Surprisal-based features 主导的发现与 DPI 理论一致，被 reviewer 视为 \\\"expected alignment\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-006\",\n    \"description\": \"Downstream filtering evaluation: 6 strategies × 5 seeds, MMLU + HellaSwag\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"binary_ours_mmlu\": \"0.5941±0.0008\",\n      \"binary_ours_hellaswag\": \"0.6701±0.0006\",\n      \"no_filter_mmlu\": \"0.5865±0.0010\",\n      \"no_filter_hellaswag\": \"0.6638±0.0008\",\n      \"delta_mmlu_binary_vs_nofilter\": \"+0.0076\",\n      \"delta_hellaswag_binary_vs_nofilter\": \"+0.0063\",\n      \"base_model_mmlu\": 0.6018,\n      \"graduated_a09_mmlu\": \"0.5892±0.0008\",\n      \"dsir_mmlu\": \"0.5869±0.0003\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 5: Filtering strategy comparison (Qwen2.5-1.5B, 30% contamination)\",\n        \"content\": \"| Strategy | MMLU | HellaSwag | Δ MMLU vs no-filter |\\n|----------|------|-----------|-------------------|\\n| binary-ours | 0.5941±0.0008 | 0.6701±0.0006 | +0.0076* |\\n| binary-Drayson | 0.5913±0.0009 | 0.6691±0.0004 | +0.0048* |\\n| surprisal | 0.5894±0.0009 | 0.6641±0.0006 | +0.0029 |\\n| graduated α=0.9 | 0.5892±0.0008 | 0.6701±0.0007 | +0.0027 |\\n| DSIR | 0.5869±0.0003 | 0.6631±0.0007 | +0.0004 |\\n| no-filter | 0.5865±0.0010 | 0.6638±0.0008 | — |\\n| base (no contam.) | 0.6018 | 0.6821 | — |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Median 档 reviewer 给 C3 的 substance score ~2.5-3.0。核心攻击点： 1. Effect size 太小（<1pp MMLU）不够 actionable 2. Binary > graduated 说明 K* boundary 信息对 curation 有用，但增益微小 3. 所有策略 degrade vs base_model 暗示 filtering 的 ceiling 低 C3 需要从 \\\"validation\\\" 降级为 \\\"case study / demonstration\\\"。\\n\\n\\nBinary-ours 在所有策略中最优，但 MMLU 增益仅 +0.76pp vs no-filter。 在 median 档下，这是 C3 的核心弱点（A5_fail）： (a) MMLU Δ=0.76pp 被 reviewer 质疑 practical significance——\\\"Is <1pp improvement  worth the curation complexity?\\\" (b) 所有策略都 degrade vs base_model（0.6018→0.5941），说明 contaminated data 的  fundamental harm 无法被 filtering 完全消除 (c) Graduated α 单调递增确认 K*=2 boundary，但 reviewer 指出这是 circular reasoning—— 用 K* 设计 filtering 然后用 filtering 验证 K* (d) DSIR 表现差（接近 no-filter）是一个正面结果，但 reviewer 质疑 DSIR baseline  的公平性（DSIR 不是为 depth-aware filtering 设计的）\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-007\",\n    \"description\": \"K* sensitivity at θ=0.55/0.60/0.65/0.70 + bootstrap CI + permutation test\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"all_1v2_ci_lower_above_060\": true,\n      \"most_marginal\": \"Qwen-cont CI lower=0.6015\",\n      \"theta_055_k_star_distribution\": \"all models K*=2 or K*=3\",\n      \"theta_060_k_star_distribution\": \"7/8 K*=2, 1/8 K*=1 (Mistral)\",\n      \"theta_065_k_star_distribution\": \"4-5/8 K*=2, rest K*=1\",\n      \"theta_070_k_star_distribution\": \"most K*=1\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 4: K* sensitivity to threshold θ\",\n        \"content\": \"| θ | K*=1 | K*=2 | K*=3 |\\n|------|------|------|------|\\n| 0.55 | 0/8  | 7/8  | 1/8  |\\n| 0.60 | 1/8  | 7/8  | 0/8  |\\n| 0.65 | 3-4/8 | 4-5/8 | 0/8 |\\n| 0.70 | 6-7/8 | 1-2/8 | 0/8 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"θ-sensitivity 被 median 档 reviewer 视为 \\\"fair analysis\\\" 但 robustness concern 未完全消除。 关键辩护：θ=0.60 对应 Cohen's h≈0.20（small effect size threshold）， 且 1v2 vs 2v3 的 AUC gap 远大于 θ 选择的 sensitivity range。 Reviewer 接受 [0.55, 0.65] 稳定性但仍认为 \\\"the result is more about where you draw the line  than about the underlying phenomenon\\\"。\\n\\n\\nθ-sensitivity 是 median 档的关键攻击面（A6_partial）。 θ=0.60 下 7/8 configurations K*=2 被接受，但 θ=0.70 下多数降至 K*=1 被 reviewer 放大—— \\\"The finding is highly sensitive to threshold choice. At θ=0.70, the headline result  (K*=2 as dominant mode) collapses.\\\" Qwen-cont CI lower=0.6015 被 A8_attacked 假设触发——reviewer 要求 sensitivity analysis  或额外 seeds 来确认这不是 noise。 论文需要在主文（非 appendix）展示 θ-sensitivity figure，正面呈现 K* 在 [0.55, 0.65]  范围内的稳定性，并以 Cohen's h=0.20 和 AUC gap discontinuity 为 θ=0.60 选择辩护。 Permutation test p<0.001 对所有 boundary pairs 提供统计支持，但 reviewer 指出  \\\"statistical significance ≠ practical significance at these effect sizes\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-008\",\n    \"description\": \"Retrain-chain ecological validity: Pythia-1.4B LoRA, C4 5K docs, depth 0-4\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k_star\": \">=4\",\n      \"pairwise_auc_0v1\": 0.9847,\n      \"pairwise_auc_1v2\": 0.9484,\n      \"pairwise_auc_2v3\": 0.8888,\n      \"pairwise_auc_3v4\": 0.7982\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 6: Prompt-chain vs Retrain-chain comparison\",\n        \"content\": \"| Pair | Prompt-chain AUC | Retrain-chain AUC |\\n|------|-----------------|-------------------|\\n| 0v1  | 0.993 | 0.985 |\\n| 1v2  | 0.654 | 0.948 |\\n| 2v3  | 0.552 | 0.889 |\\n| 3v4  | 0.515 | 0.798 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"强有力的 supporting evidence。Median 档 reviewer 肯定此实验的 ecological validity 贡献， 但建议正文讨论 \\\"real-world contamination likely falls between prompt-chain and retrain-chain\\\"。\\n\\n\\nRetrain-chain K*≥4 与 prompt-chain K*=2 的对比是重要的 ecological validity argument。 LoRA fine-tune 每代引入 cumulative model artifacts（vocabulary narrowing, repetition bias）， 使各代高度可区分。Median 档下 reviewer 接受 \\\"prompt-chain isolates text-intrinsic degradation\\\"  的论点，但 1 个 reviewer 认为这说明 \\\"in practice, retrain-chain contamination is more  detectable, so K*=2 underestimates real-world detectability\\\"——这实际上对论文有利 （prompt-chain K*=2 是 conservative estimate），但 reviewer 的 framing 是  \\\"the paper should discuss this more prominently\\\"。 3v4 AUC=0.7982 远超 θ=0.60，所有 pairs 在 retrain-chain 下都高度可区分， 证明 K* 的低有界性是 prompt-chain (text-intrinsic) 特有的。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-009\",\n    \"description\": \"Contamination dose-response: 10%/30%/50% ratio × 3 strategies × 5 seeds\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"binary_consistently_best\": true,\n      \"graduated_equals_no_filter\": true,\n      \"hellaswag_binary_significant_all_ratios\": true,\n      \"mmlu_binary_30pct_p\": 0.074,\n      \"effect_size_increases_with_contamination\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 7: Dose-response analysis\",\n        \"content\": \"| Ratio | Strategy | MMLU | HellaSwag |\\n|-------|----------|------|-----------|\\n| 10% | binary | 0.6079 | 0.6727** |\\n| 10% | graduated | 0.6066 | 0.6700 |\\n| 10% | no-filter | 0.6058 | 0.6689 |\\n| 30% | binary | 0.6082 | 0.6725** |\\n| 30% | graduated | 0.6072 | 0.6665 |\\n| 30% | no-filter | 0.6069 | 0.6664 |\\n| 50% | binary | 0.6088 | 0.6731** |\\n| 50% | graduated | 0.6062 | 0.6679 |\\n| 50% | no-filter | 0.6063 | 0.6680 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Binary filtering 的 dose-response consistency 是 C3 的最强证据。 但 graduated=no-filter 的一致性同时说明 K*-aware graduated curation 无增量价值—— 这直接削弱了 \\\"K* informs curation granularity\\\" 的 narrative。 Median 档下 C3 的 reviewer 评分因此在 2.5-3.0 区间。\\n\\n\\nDose-response 确认 binary filtering 在所有 contamination ratio 下一致最优， graduated filtering 在每个 ratio 下都崩溃至 no-filter 水平。 在 median 档下： (a) HellaSwag 显著性是正面证据（p≤0.004 at all ratios） (b) MMLU 在 30% ratio 下 p=0.074 不显著——reviewer 注意到 \\\"inconsistent significance  across benchmarks weakens the claim\\\"（A5_fail 部分触发） (c) Effect size 随 contamination ratio 增加（10%: +0.38pp, 30%: +0.61pp, 50%: +0.51pp HellaSwag）， 但绝对值仍然小 (d) 一个 reviewer 肯定 dose-response 设计的 thoroughness，但另一个认为  \\\"50% synthetic injection is unrealistic for current web data\\\"\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-010\",\n    \"description\": \"CORAL vs multiclass LightGBM vs ordinal logistic regression\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"obd_lgbm_best_accuracy\": 0.4229,\n      \"multiclass_lgbm_accuracy\": 0.4182,\n      \"ordinal_logreg_best_tau\": 0.563,\n      \"obd_lgbm_best_mae\": 0.9836\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table A3: Classifier comparison\",\n        \"content\": \"| Method | Acc | MAE | τ_b | Mean PW-AUC |\\n|--------|-----|-----|-----|-------------|\\n| OBD-LightGBM | 0.423 | 0.984 | 0.552 | 0.621 |\\n| Multiclass-LightGBM | 0.418 | 1.016 | 0.537 | 0.625 |\\n| Ordinal LogReg | 0.364 | 0.911 | 0.563 | 0.502 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Appendix material。Median 档 reviewer 不质疑也不 highlight。\\n\\n\\nOBD-LightGBM 在 accuracy 和 mean_pw_auc 上略优于 multiclass LightGBM， 但差异小（Δacc < 0.5pp）。Ordinal logistic regression MAE 最低但 accuracy 最差。 Median 档下 reviewer 不特别关注此实验——它是 methodology 的 supporting evidence， 不构成独立卖点。Reviewer 认为 \\\"the choice between ordinal and multiclass classifiers  is an implementation detail, not a contribution\\\"。 但 ordinal structure 的存在（CORAL MAE < multiclass MAE across all models） 为论文的 \\\"depth is ordinal, not categorical\\\" framing 提供小幅支持。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-011\",\n    \"description\": \"GPT-5.5 / Claude Opus 4.6 zero-shot depth estimation baseline\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"gpt55_5class_acc\": 0.332,\n      \"claude_5class_acc\": 0.331,\n      \"gpt55_binary_acc\": 0.878,\n      \"claude_binary_acc\": 0.882,\n      \"odb_baseline_5class_acc\": 0.386\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 8: LLM zero-shot vs OBD baseline\",\n        \"content\": \"| Method | 5-class Acc | MAE | Binary Acc |\\n|--------|------------|-----|-----------|\\n| GPT-5.5 | 0.332 | 1.102 | 0.878 |\\n| Claude Opus 4.6 | 0.331 | 1.150 | 0.882 |\\n| OBD-LightGBM | 0.386 | 1.107 | — |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Median 档 reviewer 正面评价此 baseline，但 McNemar test non-significant (p~0.07-0.08)  被注意——\\\"The advantage of OBD over frontier LLMs is not statistically significant.\\\"\\n\\n\\nFrontier LLMs 在 5-class depth estimation 上表现不如 OBD-LightGBM（33% vs 39%）， 但 binary detection 高达 88%。这是一个 strong baseline comparison： (a) 证明 depth estimation 需要 specialized features，不能 \\\"throw LLM at it\\\" (b) Binary detection 高但 fine-grained depth 失败，支持 \\\"binary ≠ depth\\\" 的 claim Median 档下 reviewer 对此实验评价较正面——\\\"Good to include, demonstrates the problem  is not trivially solvable.\\\"但 1 个 reviewer 指出 OBD 也只有 39% accuracy， \\\"both methods are poor at fine-grained depth estimation, which raises the question  of whether depth estimation beyond K* is even meaningful\\\"。 这实际上对 K* characterization 有利（K* 之后的深度确实无法区分）， 但被 reviewer 解读为对整体 contribution 的 dampener。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-012\",\n    \"description\": \"DivEye/Binoculars binary detector confidence as depth proxy\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"binary_detector_kstar\": 1,\n      \"obd_kstar\": 2,\n      \"spearman_rho_range\": \"0.06-0.46\",\n      \"auc_non_monotonic\": true,\n      \"six_class_accuracy_max\": 0.199\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table A4: Binary detector depth estimation\",\n        \"content\": \"| Generator | 6-class Acc | ρ (ppl_ratio) | AUC monotonic? |\\n|-----------|------------|--------------|---------------|\\n| Qwen-rw | 0.199 | 0.119 | ❌ |\\n| Pythia | 0.130 | -0.392 | ❌ |\\n| OLMo | 0.127 | -0.407 | ❌ |\\n| Qwen-cont | 0.183 | -0.058 | ❌ |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Strong justification for the paper's approach。Median 档下被 reviewer 正面引用。\\n\\n\\nBinary detectors K*≈1 vs OBD K*=2，6-class accuracy 接近 random（≤0.199 vs 0.167 random）。 Spearman correlation 弱且非单调。直接支持 \\\"binary confidence ≠ depth\\\" 的 claim。 Median 档下 reviewer 接受此结论——\\\"Well-designed experiment that justifies the need for  depth-aware features beyond binary detection.\\\" 不被特别攻击。 但 reviewer 注意到 DivEye/Binoculars 都是 perplexity-based， 建议加入 watermark-based 或 learned detectors 作为 baseline。论文无此 baseline  被视为 minor weakness 而非 major concern。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-013\",\n    \"description\": \"4×4 cross-model transfer matrix\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"pythia_olmo_retention\": \"91-92%\",\n      \"qwen_cont_cross_retention\": \"80-85%\",\n      \"qwen_rw_cross_retention\": \"61-63%\",\n      \"binary_0v1_cross_all_above_096\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 9: Cross-model transfer retention\",\n        \"content\": \"| Transfer Direction | Accuracy Retention |\\n|-------------------|-------------------|\\n| Pythia → OLMo | 92% |\\n| OLMo → Pythia | 91% |\\n| Qwen-cont → Pythia | 85% |\\n| Qwen-cont → OLMo | 80% |\\n| Qwen-rw → Pythia | 63% |\\n| Qwen-rw → OLMo | 61% |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Median 档 reviewer 评价：C1' 的 strongest supporting evidence 之一。 Transfer > 80% 在 continuation mode 下消除 scorer bias 质疑。\\n\\n\\nCross-model transfer 是 C1' \\\"text-intrinsic signal\\\" 的核心证据。 Pythia↔OLMo 91-92% retention 和 0v1 cross-AUC > 0.96 强力支持 depth signal 跨模型可迁移。 Median 档下 reviewer 正面评价： (a) \\\"The high transfer retention confirms K* is not a self-familiarity artifact\\\" (b) Qwen-rewrite 低 transfer (61-63%) 进一步区分 generation mode effect vs depth signal (c) 但 reviewer 指出 \\\"all models are ≤8B from similar training distributions,  transfer to fundamentally different models (e.g., 70B, multilingual) remains unknown\\\" 这与 A3 (scale limitation) 呼应。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-014\",\n    \"description\": \"Naturalistic validation: Common Crawl 2025/2026 snapshot depth prediction\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"predicted_depth_distribution\": {\n        \"depth_0\": \"60-75%\",\n        \"depth_1\": \"15-25%\",\n        \"depth_2_plus\": \"5-15%\"\n      },\n      \"correlation_with_alignscore\": \"Spearman ρ=0.15-0.30\",\n      \"correlation_with_vocab_richness\": \"Spearman ρ=0.20-0.35\",\n      \"predicted_contamination_rate\": \"25-40%\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"未执行。Median 档下不影响核心评分但作为 future work 建议出现在 reviewer comments 中。\\n\\n\\nNaturalistic validation 在 median 档下是 P2 优先级，未执行。 如果执行，预期结果：Common Crawl 2025/2026 中约 25-40% 文本被预测为 depth ≥1（合成文本）， 与外部估计一致。但 ground truth 缺失使此实验无法做定量验证—— 只能做 correlation with proxy metrics。AlignScore correlation 弱（ρ~0.15-0.30） 因为 AlignScore 度量的是事实一致性而非 generational depth。 Vocab richness correlation 略强（ρ~0.20-0.35）因为递归生成确实导致 vocabulary narrowing。 Median 档 reviewer 对此实验缺失不会严重扣分（P2 priority）， 但 1 个 reviewer 可能建议 \\\"a naturalistic study would strengthen the paper's practical relevance\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-015\",\n    \"description\": \"Frozen Qwen2.5-1.5B embeddings + MLP probe vs 15D features\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"pythia_k_star_neural\": 2,\n      \"olmo_k_star_neural\": 2,\n      \"qwen_cont_k_star_neural\": 3,\n      \"qwen_cont_2v3_neural_auc\": 0.616,\n      \"qwen_cont_2v3_neural_ci_lower\": 0.6099\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table A5: Neural probe vs 15D features\",\n        \"content\": \"| Model | K*(15D) | K*(neural) | 2v3 AUC (neural) |\\n|-------|---------|-----------|-----------------|\\n| Pythia-1.4B | 2 | 2 | 0.596 |\\n| OLMo-1B | 2 | 2 | 0.589 |\\n| Qwen-cont | 2 | 3 | 0.616 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Median 档下 reviewer 接受 \\\"model-free features for headline K*\\\" 的选择， 但 Qwen K*_neural=3 被部分 reviewer 用来质疑 K*=2 universality。 需要 framing: \\\"K*(neural) is representation-dependent; K*(model-free) is the conservative,  universal measure we recommend for cross-model comparisons.\\\"\\n\\n\\nNeural probe 结果分裂：Pythia/OLMo K*_neural=2（与 15D 一致），Qwen-cont K*_neural=3（高于 15D）。 Qwen-cont 的差异来自 self-scorer advantage——Qwen 的 embeddings 对自己生成的文本有额外 depth signal。 Median 档下 reviewer 解读： (a) Pythia/OLMo K*_neural=2 confirms \\\"K*=2 is data-intrinsic, not feature-engineering artifact\\\" (b) Qwen K*_neural=3 被 reviewer 解读为 \\\"model-dependent K* exists in learned representations,  which contradicts the 'K* is purely text-intrinsic' narrative\\\" (c) 论文需要 careful framing：model-free 15D features 给出 universal K*， neural probe 给出 model-dependent K*——两者都是 valid 但 serve different purposes (d) 这实际上是 A8_attacked 的延伸——Qwen self-scorer 的 +1 bias 在 neural probe 中更明显\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-016\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-1.5B base vs Instruct continuation mode comparison\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k_star\": 2,\n      \"base_1v2_auc\": 0.6262,\n      \"base_ci_lower\": 0.6168,\n      \"instruct_1v2_auc\": 0.6112,\n      \"instruct_ci_lower\": 0.6015,\n      \"ci_overlap\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table A6: Base vs Instruct\",\n        \"content\": \"| Variant | 1v2 AUC | 95% CI | K* |\\n|---------|---------|--------|-----|\\n| Base | 0.626 | [0.617, 0.635] | 2 |\\n| Instruct | 0.611 | [0.602, 0.621] | 2 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Supporting evidence for K* robustness across base/instruct variants。不是 highlight。\\n\\n\\nBase 和 Instruct K* 一致=2，CI 重叠说明 instruction tuning 不改变 K*。 但 base 1v2 AUC (0.6262) > instruct (0.6112)，即 instruction tuning 轻微降低  depth discrimination signal（可能因为 RLHF 增加了生成多样性）。 Median 档下 reviewer 不特别关注此实验——\\\"Expected result, instruction tuning should  not fundamentally change text-intrinsic depth properties.\\\" 但 base CI lower=0.6168 vs instruct CI lower=0.6015 的差距被注意—— 如果 instruction tuning 进一步降低 signal（如更强的 RLHF），K* 可能降至 1。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-017\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct continuation mode, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k_star\": 2,\n      \"pairwise_auc_1v2\": 0.6112,\n      \"ci_1v2_lower\": 0.6015,\n      \"pairwise_auc_2v3\": 0.5609\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 2 (row): Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct continuation\",\n        \"content\": \"| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | 3v4 | 4v5 | K* |\\n|-------|------|------|------|------|------|----|\\n| Qwen-1.5B-Inst cont | 0.997 | 0.611 | 0.561 | 0.541 | 0.514 | 2 |\\n| 95% CI (1v2) | — | [0.602, 0.621] | — | — | — | — |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Median 档核心攻击目标。需要在论文中显式承认 borderline nature 并提供多层辩护。 Cross-scorer 和 θ-sensitivity 数据在正文中呈现而非藏在 appendix。\\n\\n\\nQwen-cont 1v2 AUC=0.6112，CI lower=0.6015——仅高于 θ 0.15pp。 在 median 档下这是 A8_attacked 的核心：reviewer 单独点名 \\\"CI lower=0.6015 is dangerously  close to the threshold. A few different random seeds could flip this to K*=1.\\\" 要求 sensitivity analysis：(a) 额外 seeds/bootstrap resamples，(b) θ 微调下的稳定性， (c) cross-scorer validation 下的变化。 exp-022 中 qwen_cont256×pythia K*=1 (1v2=0.5979) 进一步加剧了这个 concern—— 当 scorer 从 Qwen 换成 Pythia 时，Qwen-cont 确实可以翻转为 K*=1。 论文需要承认 Qwen-cont 处于 K*=1 和 K*=2 的边界，并以此作为 θ-sensitivity 讨论的案例。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-018\",\n    \"description\": \"LLaMA-3.1-8B, continuation mode, C4 5K docs, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k_star\": 2,\n      \"pairwise_auc_1v2\": 0.6123,\n      \"ci_1v2_lower\": 0.6028,\n      \"ci_1v2_upper\": 0.6216\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 2 (row): LLaMA-3.1-8B C4 continuation\",\n        \"content\": \"| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | 3v4 | 4v5 | K* |\\n|-------|------|------|------|------|------|----|\\n| LLaMA-3.1-8B | 0.923 | 0.612 | 0.527 | 0.514 | 0.510 | 2 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"LLaMA 的低 0v1 AUC (0.9225 vs others >0.96) 被 median 档 reviewer 解读为  \\\"larger models produce more human-like text\\\"——这与 A3 (scale limitation) 呼应： 更大模型可能导致 0v1 也接近 threshold。\\n\\n\\nLLaMA-8B K*=2，CI lower=0.6028 (余量 +0.28pp)。 第三个模型家族确认 C4 K*=2，增强跨架构证据。 Median 档下 reviewer 接受 LLaMA 结果但注意到： (a) CI lower=0.6028 也较边缘（虽不如 Qwen-cont 的 0.6015 极端） (b) 0v1 AUC=0.9225 是所有模型中最低的——暗示 LLaMA 的 continuation  生成与原文更相似（model quality 更高），导致整体 signal 更弱 (c) 但 K* 仍=2，支持 \\\"K* is domain-determined regardless of absolute signal strength\\\"\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-019\",\n    \"description\": \"Mistral-7B-v0.3, continuation mode, C4 5K docs, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k_star\": 1,\n      \"pairwise_auc_1v2\": 0.5935,\n      \"ci_1v2_lower\": 0.5835,\n      \"ci_1v2_upper\": 0.6032,\n      \"p_auc_leq_060\": 0.9017\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 2 (row): Mistral-7B C4 continuation (K*=1 outlier)\",\n        \"content\": \"| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | 3v4 | 4v5 | K* |\\n|-------|------|------|------|------|------|----|\\n| Mistral-7B | 0.984 | 0.594 | 0.540 | 0.523 | 0.518 | 1 |\\n| 95% CI (1v2) | — | [0.584, 0.603] | — | — | — | — |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Median 档核心攻击点之一。论文需要正面讨论 Mistral K*=1 而非 downplay， 并用 Mistral arXiv K*=3 证明 domain 仍是 primary driver。 \\\"Sole determinant\\\" → \\\"primary factor\\\" 的降级措辞是 median 档的必要调整。\\n\\n\\nMistral K*=1 是唯一的 C4 outlier（7/8 K*=2 中的例外）。 1v2 AUC=0.5935 < θ=0.60，CI upper=0.6032 仅微超 θ，说明 Mistral 一代后即 one-wash。 Median 档下的 reviewer 反应分裂： (a) Reviewer A 接受 \\\"7/8 dominant mode K*=2, with Mistral as interpretable outlier\\\" (b) Reviewer B 攻击 \\\"If 1/8 models gives K*=1, how can you claim K*=2 is universal?  This is evidence of model×domain interaction, not pure domain dependence.\\\" Cross-scorer validation (exp-019b) 确认 K*=1 是 text-intrinsic（non-scorer artifact）， 但这并不能回应 \\\"model matters\\\" 的质疑。 Mistral arXiv K*=3 (exp_arXiv_mistral7b) 是关键回应——同一模型在不同域给出不同 K*， 证明 domain 仍是 primary factor。但 reviewer 认为这只是 \\\"primary, not sole\\\"。 论文需要从 \\\"sole determinant\\\" 降级为 \\\"primary factor, with residual model effects\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-020\",\n    \"description\": \"Pythia-1.4B decoding ablation: 4 strategies, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"all_k_star_2\": true,\n      \"greedy_1v2\": 0.8838,\n      \"nuc09_1v2\": 0.677,\n      \"t07_1v2\": 0.7265,\n      \"t12_1v2\": 0.6172\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table A7: Pythia decoding ablation\",\n        \"content\": \"| Decoding | 1v2 AUC | 2v3 AUC | K* |\\n|----------|---------|---------|-----|\\n| greedy | 0.884 | 0.534 | 2 |\\n| nucleus p=0.9 | 0.677 | 0.555 | 2 |\\n| T=0.7 | 0.727 | 0.594 | 2 |\\n| T=1.2 | 0.617 | 0.523 | 2 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Supporting evidence，放 Appendix。Greedy 的 repetition collapse 作为 caveat 在正文中提及。\\n\\n\\nPythia 上 4 种解码策略 K* 全部=2，跨模型复制 exp-003 的解码不变性。 Greedy 1v2=0.8838 极高——因为 greedy decoding 引入 repetition collapse， 使 depth 1 和 depth 2 文本差异大。T=1.2 的 1v2=0.6172 最低（高温增加随机性，模糊差异）。 Median 档下 reviewer 正面评价跨模型 decoding invariance： \\\"K*=2 holds across 2 models × 4 decoding strategies = 8 conditions, which is convincing.\\\" 但 greedy 的异常高 AUC 被注意——\\\"greedy is a degenerate condition that amplifies artifacts,  it shouldn't be treated as equally valid.\\\"\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-021\",\n    \"description\": \"Text length ablation: 128/256/512 tokens, Qwen continuation\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"128tok_k_star\": 2,\n      \"256tok_k_star\": 2,\n      \"512tok_k_star\": 2,\n      \"512tok_1v2_ci_lower\": 0.5979,\n      \"512tok_verdict\": \"BORDERLINE\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table A8: Length ablation\",\n        \"content\": \"| Length | 1v2 AUC | CI lower | K* |\\n|--------|---------|---------|-----|\\n| 128 tok | 0.622 | >0.60 | 2 |\\n| 256 tok | 0.628 | >0.60 | 2 |\\n| 512 tok | 0.607 | 0.598 | 2* |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"512-token borderline 被 median 档 reviewer 视为 minor concern。 与 Qwen-cont CI lower=0.6015 的边缘性一起被归入 \\\"robustness limitations\\\" 段。\\n\\n\\nK*=2 在三种长度下一致。但 512tok 的 CI lower=0.5979 < θ 是 borderline failure—— 在 median 档下 reviewer 注意到 \\\"longer texts paradoxically reduce discriminability,  which is counter-intuitive and requires explanation.\\\" 解释：512 tokens 的 continuation 更有空间 converge to the generator's style， 使 depth 1 和 depth 2 更相似。这与 \\\"one-wash laundering\\\" 概念一致。 但 reviewer 认为 \\\"if the result flips at 512 tokens, the 256-token headline results  may be cherry-picking the optimal length.\\\" 论文需要承认 length sensitivity 并在主文讨论。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-022\",\n    \"description\": \"4×4 cross-scorer matrix: 4 generators × 4 scorers\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k_star_2_count\": 11,\n      \"k_star_1_count\": 1,\n      \"exception\": \"qwen_cont256×pythia (1v2=0.5979)\",\n      \"scorer_delta_within_generator\": \"<0.025\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 10: Cross-scorer matrix (selected)\",\n        \"content\": \"| Generator × Scorer | 1v2 AUC | K* |\\n|-------------------|---------|-----|\\n| Qwen-base × OLMo | 0.605 | 2 |\\n| Qwen-base × Pythia | 0.617 | 2 |\\n| Qwen-cont × Pythia | 0.598 | 1 |\\n| Qwen-cont × Qwen-base | 0.628 | 2 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Scorer independence confirmed。论文在正文中展示完整矩阵以预防 \\\"self-scorer bias\\\" 攻击。\\n\\n\\n11/12 combos K*=2 是 scorer independence 的强证据。 唯一例外 qwen_cont256×pythia (K*=1) 被 reviewer 注意但不被严重攻击—— 因为 Qwen-cont 本身就是最 marginal 的 generator（CI lower=0.6015）， 换 scorer 后 flip 到 K*=1 是 consistent with its borderline nature。 Median 档下 reviewer 正面评价：\\\"Scorer independence is well-established.  The paper correctly identifies and discusses the single exception.\\\" 但 A8_attacked 的 reviewer 用这个数据加强攻击：\\\"Even with different scorers,  Qwen-cont is unstable.\\\"\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-023\",\n    \"description\": \"Wikipedia domain, Qwen2.5-1.5B base continuation, 5K docs, depth 0-5\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k_star\": 2,\n      \"one_v_two_auc\": 0.6193,\n      \"all_folds_above_060\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 11 (row): Wikipedia domain K*\",\n        \"content\": \"| Domain | Scorer | 1v2 AUC | K* |\\n|--------|--------|---------|-----|\\n| Wikipedia | Qwen (same-family) | 0.619 | 2 |\\n| Wikipedia | Pythia (cross-family) | 0.585 | 1 |\\n| Wikipedia | scorer-controlled | — | 1 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Scorer confound on Wikipedia 是 honest reporting，增加论文可信度。 但 K*=1 for Wikipedia 被 reviewer 解读为 \\\"trivial — one generation washes everything.\\\"\\n\\n\\nWikipedia K*=2 (same-family scorer) 但经 D060 cross-scorer confound 分析后降为 K*=1。 这是 median 档中 scorer confound 的 key demonstration： Qwen same-family scorer 在 Wikipedia 上给出 +1 bias（K*=2）， 换 Pythia cross-family scorer 后 K*=1。 论文正文报告 scorer-controlled K*=1 for Wikipedia, Appendix 披露 confound 细节。 Reviewer 接受 confound 控制但质疑：\\\"If the simplest domain already saturates at K*=1,  and web text at K*=2, the range {1,2,3} is very narrow.  Is the finding essentially that recursive generation quickly loses information?\\\" 这触发 A1 (\\\"somewhat expected\\\")。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-024\",\n    \"description\": \"arXiv domain, Qwen2.5-1.5B base continuation, 5K docs, depth 0-5\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k_star\": 3,\n      \"pairwise_auc_1v2\": 0.858,\n      \"pairwise_auc_2v3\": 0.6427,\n      \"ci_2v3_lower\": 0.6275\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 11 (row): arXiv domain K*\",\n        \"content\": \"| Domain | 1v2 AUC | 2v3 AUC | 3v4 AUC | K* |\\n|--------|---------|---------|---------|-----|\\n| arXiv | 0.858 | 0.643 | 0.544 | 3 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"K*=3 on arXiv 是论文的 strongest individual finding，但 3-domain limitation 被 reviewer 攻击。 exp_027 LaTeX ablation (K*=3 preserved after stripping) 有效消除格式 confound。\\n\\n\\narXiv K*=3 是 domain dependence 的最强证据——首个 K*>2 的条件。 2v3 AUC=0.6427, CI lower=0.6275 >> θ=0.60（余量 +2.75pp）。 1v2 AUC=0.858 远超 C4/Wiki (~0.61-0.69)，arXiv 的 LaTeX/citation/math  结构特征提供额外 depth-distinguishing signal。 Median 档下 reviewer 反应： (a) 正面：K*=3 on arXiv is a genuinely interesting finding, domain dependence is well-demonstrated (b) 攻击：A2 假设触发——\\\"3 domains is too few to claim 'domain is the sole determinant'.  What about code, legal text, news, social media?\\\" (c) 建议：需要更多域来充分支持 domain hierarchy claim 论文需要降级措辞从 \\\"sole determinant\\\" 到 \\\"primary factor\\\"， 承认 3 domains 是 initial evidence 而非 exhaustive characterization。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-025\",\n    \"description\": \"Pythia-1.4B filtering replication: 3 strategies × 3 seeds\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"all_strategies_nearly_identical\": true,\n      \"max_delta_mmlu\": 0.0017,\n      \"binary_hellaswag_delta\": \"+0.0000\",\n      \"key_finding\": \"null result\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table A9: Pythia filtering (null result)\",\n        \"content\": \"| Strategy | MMLU | HellaSwag |\\n|----------|------|-----------|\\n| binary-ours | 0.259±0.000 | 0.525±0.000 |\\n| graduated α=0.9 | 0.256±0.001 | 0.525±0.001 |\\n| no-filter | 0.257±0.001 | 0.525±0.001 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Null result。放 Appendix 作为 honest reporting。 C3 的证据链因此完全依赖 exp-006 (Qwen) 和 exp-009 (dose-response)。 Median 档 reviewer 评价 C3 substance ~2.5。\\n\\n\\nPythia-1.4B 上三种策略产生几乎相同结果（max Δ=0.0017 MMLU），filtering ordering 未确认。 Median 档下这是 C3 的严重打击（A5_fail 部分）： (a) Pythia 太小（1.4B, MMLU~0.26）对 filtering signal 不敏感——模型 capacity 不足 (b) 但 reviewer 质疑 \\\"if filtering doesn't help even small models, why should we trust  it helps larger ones?\\\" (c) 论文需要 framing：Pythia 的 base capability 太低（MMLU=0.26 接近 random）， filtering 的 marginal benefit 在 low-capability regime 被淹没 (d) 这个 null result 被 1 个 reviewer 肯定（\\\"honest reporting of negative results\\\"）， 被另一个 reviewer 用来质疑 C3 整体证据链\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-026\",\n    \"description\": \"arXiv graduated vs binary filtering: Qwen base + LoRA, K*=3 domain, 3 strategies × 5 seeds\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"graduated_equals_no_filter\": true,\n      \"binary_mmlu_delta\": \"-0.0023\",\n      \"binary_hellaswag_delta\": \"+0.0042\",\n      \"graduated_mmlu_delta\": \"+0.0001\",\n      \"graduated_hellaswag_delta\": \"-0.0001\",\n      \"key_finding\": \"null result — graduated ≈ no_filter on K*=3 domain\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 12: arXiv filtering results (negative)\",\n        \"content\": \"| Strategy | MMLU | HellaSwag | Δ MMLU | Δ HellaSwag |\\n|----------|------|-----------|--------|-------------|\\n| no-filter | 0.590±0.001 | 0.660±0.000 | — | — |\\n| binary | 0.588±0.000 | 0.664±0.000 | -0.002 | +0.004* |\\n| graduated α=0.9 | 0.590±0.001 | 0.660±0.000 | +0.000 | -0.000 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Negative result honestly reported。Section 5 adds this as \\\"boundary conditions of K*-aware curation.\\\" Discussion adds key insight: \\\"K* ≠ data utility.\\\"  Median 档 negative_result_credibility_boost = 0.0-0.5（modest boost from honesty,  offset by weakened C3）。\\n\\n\\n这是 C3 的 fatal blow：即使在 K*=3 域（理论上 graduated 应该有优势）， graduated ≈ no_filter，binary 有 metric-specific trade-off（MMLU -0.23pp, HellaSwag +0.42pp）。 Median 档下 A5_fail 完全触发： (a) \\\"If graduated filtering fails even on K*=3 where it should work best,  the entire K*-aware curation thesis is undermined\\\" (b) 论文需要将 C3 降级为 \\\"case study\\\" 而非 \\\"validation\\\" (c) 关键 insight（放 Discussion）：K* characterizes signal discriminability,  not data utility — depth 2-3 text is statistically distinguishable but removing it  doesn't improve training (d) Binary filtering 的 HellaSwag 优势可能来自 removing any synthetic data  (regardless of depth)，而非 depth-aware curation (e) 1 个 reviewer 肯定这个 negative result 的 honesty， 但另一个 reviewer 认为 C3 整体不成立\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-027\",\n    \"description\": \"LaTeX markup removal ablation on arXiv data\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k_star_preserved\": true,\n      \"original_2v3\": 0.6436,\n      \"stripped_2v3\": 0.6229,\n      \"delta_2v3\": -0.021\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table A10: LaTeX ablation\",\n        \"content\": \"| Condition | 1v2 AUC | 2v3 AUC | K* |\\n|-----------|---------|---------|-----|\\n| Original | 0.858 | 0.644 | 3 |\\n| LaTeX stripped | 0.830 | 0.623 | 3 |\\n| Δ | -0.028 | -0.021 | — |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Effective confound control。Median 档 reviewer 不攻击此实验。\\n\\n\\nK*=3 在去除 LaTeX 标记后保持，2v3 AUC 从 0.6436 降至 0.6229 但仍 > θ=0.60。 LaTeX 格式贡献约 2pp AUC 但不是 K*=3 的 confound。 Median 档下 reviewer 正面评价：\\\"Good ablation that rules out the obvious confound.  K*=3 on arXiv is driven by content structural complexity, not just formatting.\\\" 但 reviewer 注意到 stripped 2v3=0.6229 余量仅 +2.29pp，如果进一步去除  other structural markers (citation patterns, section numbering), K* 可能降至 2。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-028\",\n    \"description\": \"Subsampling power curve: C4 n={1000,2000,3000,4000,5000} × 10 resamples\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_1000_k_star_2_rate\": \"6-7/10 (unstable)\",\n      \"n_2000_k_star_2_rate\": \"8-9/10 (mostly stable)\",\n      \"n_3000_k_star_2_rate\": \"9-10/10 (stable)\",\n      \"n_5000_k_star_2_rate\": \"10/10 (robust)\",\n      \"minimum_n_for_robust_k_star\": \"~2500-3000\",\n      \"ci_width_at_n_1000\": \"±0.025-0.030\",\n      \"ci_width_at_n_5000\": \"±0.010-0.012\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table A11: Subsampling power curve\",\n        \"content\": \"| n | K*=2 rate | 1v2 CI width | Median 1v2 AUC |\\n|------|-----------|-------------|---------------|\\n| 1000 | 65% | ±0.028 | 0.652 |\\n| 2000 | 85% | ±0.019 | 0.653 |\\n| 3000 | 95% | ±0.015 | 0.654 |\\n| 4000 | 98% | ±0.012 | 0.654 |\\n| 5000 | 100% | ±0.010 | 0.654 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"未执行（planned）。如果在 rebuttal 中补充，可回应 \\\"statistical power\\\" 质疑。 Median 档 reviewer 不会因缺失此实验降分但可能作为 minor revision 要求。\\n\\n\\nPower analysis 在 median 档下是 reviewer 可能要求但非 P0 的实验。如果执行： n=1000 时 CI 太宽（±2.5-3.0pp），K*=2 判定在约 60-70% resamples 中成立——不 robust。 n=3000 时稳定，n=5000 完全 robust。 这回应了 reviewer 对 sample size 的潜在质疑，并提供 practical guidance： \\\"K*=2 判定需要 ≥2500 samples per depth pair for 90% power.\\\" Median 档下如果缺少此实验，reviewer 可能在 Minor Revisions 中要求补充。 如果存在，被评为 \\\"useful methodological contribution for practitioners.\\\"\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp_arXiv_cross_validation (5-model)\",\n    \"description\": \"arXiv K*=3 cross-validation: 5 models × 4 architecture families\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"qwen_1b5_k_star\": 3,\n      \"pythia_k_star\": 3,\n      \"llama_8b_k_star\": 3,\n      \"mistral_7b_k_star\": 3,\n      \"qwen_7b_k_star\": 3,\n      \"olmo_k_star\": 1,\n      \"domain_competent_models_k3_rate\": \"5/5 (100%)\",\n      \"olmo_capacity_failure\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 13: arXiv K*=3 cross-validation\",\n        \"content\": \"| Model | Family | 2v3 AUC | K* |\\n|-------|--------|---------|-----|\\n| Qwen-1.5B | Qwen | 0.643 | 3 |\\n| Pythia-1.4B | GPT-NeoX | 0.654 | 3 |\\n| LLaMA-8B | LLaMA | 0.622 | 3 |\\n| Mistral-7B | Mistral | 0.628 | 3 |\\n| Qwen-7B | Qwen | 0.626 | 3 |\\n| OLMo-1B | OLMo | 0.503 | 1 (capacity fail) |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Domain dependence 的 crown jewel evidence。Mistral C4 K*=1 → arXiv K*=3 的跃变 是论文最有说服力的 single finding。Median 档 reviewer 评分： soundness 3.0-3.5 for C1' domain dependence sub-claim。\\n\\n\\n五个 domain-competent 模型在 arXiv 上 100% 一致 K*=3（跨 4 架构族）。 OLMo-1B K*=1 因 capacity failure（生成出域文本）。 Median 档下 reviewer 高度正面评价 domain dependence evidence： \\\"5/5 domain-competent models all yielding K*=3 on arXiv is strong cross-validation.\\\" 但 A2 仍被触发——\\\"Even with 5-model cross-validation, 3 domains is still 3 domains.  The domain hierarchy Wikipedia(1)<C4(2)<arXiv(3) could just be ordered by text complexity.\\\" Reviewer 建议增加 code/legal/social media domains。 OLMo capacity failure 被正面引用：\\\"Correctly identified as prerequisite analysis,  not counted against the domain claim.\\\"\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp_wiki_scorer_confound\",\n    \"description\": \"Wikipedia scorer confound: Qwen same-family vs Pythia cross-family scorer\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"qwen_scorer_k_star\": 2,\n      \"pythia_crossscorer_k_star\": 1,\n      \"critical_delta_1v2\": -0.024,\n      \"confound_verdict\": \"confirmed\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table A12: Wikipedia scorer confound\",\n        \"content\": \"| Scorer | 1v2 AUC | K* |\\n|--------|---------|-----|\\n| Qwen (same-family) | 0.619 | 2 |\\n| Pythia (cross-family) | 0.587 | 1 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Honest reporting 增加论文可信度。Median 档 reviewer 正面评价但用此质疑 C4 结果。\\n\\n\\nWikipedia 上 Qwen same-family scorer 给出 K*=2，换 Pythia cross-family scorer 后降为 K*=1。 Δ1v2=-0.024 证明 +1 bias 存在。Median 档下： (a) Reviewer 肯定 confound detection and control：\\\"Good scientific practice to identify  and report scorer bias.\\\" (b) 论文正文报告 K*=1 (scorer-controlled)，增加可信度 (c) 但 reviewer 追问：\\\"If same-family scorer bias exists on Wikipedia,  could it also affect C4 results (e.g., Qwen-cont CI lower=0.6015)?\\\" (d) Exp-022 的 cross-scorer matrix 部分回应这个问题（C4 上 11/12 K*=2）， 但 Qwen-cont×Pythia K*=1 加剧 concern\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp_14b_c4\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-14B, continuation mode, C4, depth 0-5 — scale extension for rebuttal\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k_star\": 2,\n      \"pairwise_auc_1v2\": 0.621,\n      \"ci_1v2_lower\": 0.6119,\n      \"ci_1v2_upper\": 0.6304\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Rebuttal Table R1: Scale extension\",\n        \"content\": \"| Scale | 1v2 AUC | CI lower | K* |\\n|-------|---------|---------|-----|\\n| 1.4B (Pythia) | 0.654 | 0.645 | 2 |\\n| 1.5B (Qwen) | 0.611 | 0.602 | 2 |\\n| 7B (Qwen) | 0.618 | 0.608 | 2 |\\n| 8B (LLaMA) | 0.612 | 0.603 | 2 |\\n| 14B (Qwen) | 0.621 | 0.612 | 2 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Rebuttal 核心证据。1.4B→14B 10× scale range 下 K*=2 一致。 如果 32B 也确认，可有效回应 A3，将 reviewer 从 \\\"significant weakness\\\" 降为 \\\"minor limitation\\\"。\\n\\n\\n14B scale 下 K*=2 维持，CI lower=0.6119 > θ（余量 +1.19pp）。 这是回应 A3 (scale limitation) 的关键 rebuttal evidence： \\\"K*=2 is confirmed from 1.4B to 14B (10× scale range), with consistent CI lower > θ.\\\" Median 档下如果在 rebuttal 中呈现： (a) 1 个 reviewer 接受 \\\"14B extends the scale range meaningfully\\\" (b) 但要求 32B 数据来确认 trend (c) exp_32b_c4 正在运行——如果也是 K*=2，rebuttal 极大增强\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp_026_arxiv_filtering_integrated\",\n    \"description\": \"arXiv graduated filtering negative result integrated into paper narrative\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"section_5_addition\": \"arXiv null result table with paired t-tests\",\n      \"discussion_insight\": \"K* ≠ data utility\",\n      \"negative_result_credibility_boost\": \"0.0-0.5\",\n      \"c3_downgrade\": \"validation → case study\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"整合 negative results 是 median 档下的最优策略。 完全不报告 → reviewer 如果知道了会更严厉；过度辩护 → 不可信。 \\\"Case study\\\" framing 是平衡点：承认 limitation 但保留 positive evidence (exp-006, exp-009)。\\n\\n将 exp-026 negative result 正式整合入论文：Section 5 增加 arXiv null result， Discussion 增加 \\\"K* characterizes discriminability, not utility\\\" 洞察。 Median 档下的效果： (a) 1 个 reviewer 明确肯定 honest reporting：\\\"The authors' willingness to report  negative results and adjust claims accordingly is commendable.\\\" (b) 但 credibility boost 被 C3 整体弱化所抵消——honestly reporting failure  doesn't make the contribution stronger, it just makes the paper more trustworthy (c) \\\"K* ≠ data utility\\\" insight 被 1 个 reviewer 视为 \\\"interesting secondary finding\\\" 但另一个 reviewer 认为 \\\"this undermines the practical motivation of the paper\\\" (d) C3 contribution 从 \\\"validation that K* informs optimal filtering granularity\\\"  降级为 \\\"case study demonstrating that K*-aware binary filtering provides modest  improvement on web text, with boundary conditions on other domains\\\"\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":640,"startLine":1,"totalLines":640}}}
